<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">1 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephriam singtang gam a Ramathaim Zophim khuo ah mikhat a um a, amin Elkanah ahi. Tuakhu Jeroham tapa, Alihu tapa, Tohu tapa, Zuph tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman zi ni anei a, khatnu min Hannah ahia, akhat zopennu min khu Peninnah ahi. Peninnah in tate anei a, hinanleh Hannah in ta anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam mipa akhuo ua kipan in Shiloh khuo ah Galkapte Mangpa be ding leh akunga kithoi dingin kumchin in ahawtou zel hi. Tualeh khum mun ah, Eli tapate Hophni leh Phinehas Mangpa siempute a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Elkanah sillat hun ahing tun tahin azi Peninnah leh atapate leh atanute zousie tanvou apie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Hannah kung ah tanvou ni ape zel hi. A it mama zieh in. Hinanleh Mangpa’n anaubu akhah pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n anaubu akhah pieh zieh a, alungthah na ding leh alung gim semsem na dingin alang nu’n Hannah a phin phin ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n kumtenga abawlzel bangin Mangpa Inn a, amanu ahawtou pouma chieng in, alungthah na dingin ana phin phin zing zieh in Hannah akap kapta a, bangma anesih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal Elkanah in akung ah “Hannah bang dinga kap kap na hiei? bang ding a ann nelou na hiei? bang ding a na lungtang dasah na hiei? tapa sawm sangin zong nanga dingin ka hoizaw sih ama?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shiloh khuo a, a neh ua adawn zou un Hannah, ading doh a, tualaitah in Siempu Eli khu Mangpa bieh Inn kot khuom bula a touna tung ah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hannah khu lunggim tahin auma Mangpa kung ah thu a ngen a, Lungkham sengin akap ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n thuchiem khat abawl a, “Aw Galkapte Mangpa na suohnu gentheina muchien leh theizing a, nang manghil lou a, na suohnu tapa nang pieh leh ama khu a damsung teng ken zong Mangpa kungah ka pe kia ding hi, tuachi’n a sam akiheusih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa mai a Hannah athum sanlai in, Eli in anephu phun ana chiemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hannah in alungsim in thu angen a; anephu mai mai apia hi, a aw akizasih hi, tuaziehin Eli in zukham hiva achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Eli in amanu kungah, “Bangtanvei ahiei zukham a na um ding? na zukham tawpta’n” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hannah in adawnga, “Kham vawt sing e pu, numei lungkham leh liengvai nu ka hibou hi, zu leh khamthei dawn kahi sih a, Mangpa masanga kalungsim luikhie ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na suohnu, Belial numei dingin ngaituo sin, kalung kimlouna leh ka chimawna dimlette zieh a tutan thugen ka hi bou hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Eli in adawnga akungah, “Hamuongtah in peitan Israel Pasian in akung a, na nget khu hing peta hen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amanu’n, akung ah “Na suohnu’n na mitmu ah deisahna tang ta hen,” achia, tuachi’n tua numei apeita a, ann ane a, tualeh amaisuo ah dana a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khumin zingmawng matah in athou ua, Mangpa abie ua apei ua, Ramah khuo a, a Inn uah atung kia ta uhi. Tualeh Elkanah in azi Hannah ave a, Mangpa’n amanu atheizing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, Hannah in nau apai a, ahun ahing tunin tapa anei a, Mangpa kunga “Ka nget khieh ahi” chiin, amin Samuel aphuota hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Elkanah leh a Innkuonpite zousie, Mangpa kunga kumchin kithoina leh thuchiem lan ding in apeitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Hannah pen ahaw tousih a; apasal kungah, “Keivang naupangin nawi angawl masangsie, kang hawtou sih ding hi. Hunkhat chienga Mangpa masanga akilat theina ding in ka hing pui ding a, khum mun ah aum denta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal Elkanah in amanu kungah “Hoi nasah bang bang in bawl in, nawi na ngawlsah masangsie ngahtadi in, Mangpa’n athu sudet ta hen” achia, tuachi’n numei khu anau nawi angawlsah masangsie a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachia nawi angawlsah zou in, tangbuong ephah khat zu savun thawl dim khat leh Bawngtal kum thum a upa khat toh, Shiloh khuo a Mangpa inn ah naupang khu apuitou ta hi. Tualeh naupang khu a neu mama nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n bawngtal khu atha zou in naupang khu Eli kung ah ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n “Pu aw, nangma na hin mabangin kei khu aw Pu, na kunga ding a Mangpa kunga thu ngennu khu kahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam naupang ngen in ka thum a, tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka nget ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin ken zong Mangpa kung ah, ka pie ahi, adamsungteng Mangpa dinga pieh ahi, achia; tuachi’n khum mun ah” Mangpa abie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Hannah athum a, “Mangpa tung ah ka lungtang a nuom seng seng a; ka kii zong Mangpa ah tawisangin a um hi. Ka melmate tungah ka kam zong letsah in a um a, aziehpen na hundamna ah ka nuom seng seng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa banga siengthou koima aum sih, Nangma chilou koima aum sih hi. I pasien uh bang suongpi dang a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kisathei tah in thugen nawnsih unlen, ki uohsahna zong na kam ua pat in pawt sih heh. Mangpa khu pilna Pasian ahi a, Ama’n nna kisemte abuuh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihatte thalpi atanta a, mi kipalpuate khu hatna a gahin aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nieng leh tai a umte’n neh ding asuithu ta ua, tualeh gilkielte khu agilkiel nawnsih uhi. Chiingnu’n ta sagi aneita a, ta tampi neinu abasamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n athat a, ahingsah zel hi, han ah apuisuh a, tualeh apuidoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n a zawngsah a, tualeh ahausa sah zel hi; Aman mi asungiem a, tualeh atawisang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman leivui apat migentheite atung dinga, vut vum akipat khutdawte aphongdoh a, miliente lah ah amauh apangsah a, thupina mangtoupha aluosah hi. Aziehpen leitung kingahna khuomte Mangpa a ahi a, Tuate tungah leitung buppi angam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ami siengthoute kalsuondan veng vanin, hinanleh migiloute khu miel lah ah asip dide ding uhi; hatna ziehin koiman azou sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa doute khu, akehnen dimdem ding ua, van a kipat in vantou in amauh adouding a, kawlmong tawp dong in Mangpa’n vai ahawm dinga; aleengpa kungah hatna ape ding a, athau nupa kii atawisang ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elkanah khu Ramah khuo a a inn ah apeita hi. Tualeh naupangpa’n siempu Eli masang ah Mangpa nna asemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eli tapate khu migiloutah ahi ua, Mangpa athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipite lah a siempute bawldan ngaina ahileh, min kithoina ahing lat chieng un, sa akihuon laitah in Siempupa suohpain sa thuana tawkeu kathum nei ahing tawi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh khangbel ahiai, singpibel leh khangbel banga akhaina nei ahiei sungah tawkeu in asunsuh a, tua tawkeu kathum a, hing bangkha pouma khu siempu tanvou ahia, akilah zel hi. Khum bangin Israel mi Shiloh a hing pei zousie tungah tuabangin abawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh asathaute ahal masang un siempu suohpa khu ahing pei a, kithoina hing lanpa kungah, “Siempu a ding em min ding sa hing pie in; nasa huon khu adeisih hi, asiel vateh adei ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuchin kithoina sil lan mi in akung a “Athaupen kihal sah masa phot unlen tuazou chiengin nadei zaza uh na la nading uhi” anachi chiengin zong, “Hilou e, nangpieh pai ding ahi, nangpieh sihleh ka paulah ding ahi,” achizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n tangvalte khelna khu Mangpa mitmu in akhawh sengseng ta a; miten Mangpa kunga sillatte angaidau law gawpta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh, Samuel in aneu lai a pat in, siempu puontuol silin Mangpa nna asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualouin zong anu’n puon ah tuol neu abawlpieh zel a, kumchin a kithoina uh lan dinga apasal toh ahing kuon chiengun ahing puoh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Eli in Elkanah leh azi khu aguolzawl a, akung uah “Mangpa kunga nalat uh tam sil ziehin Mangpa’n tam numei apat hahlesuon in hing thuh tahen” achia, tuazou in a inn lam uah akinuale zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Hannah ave a ahing gai a, tapa thum leh tanu ni anei hi; tuachi’n naupang Samuel khu Mangpa masang ah ahing khanglienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eli khu ateh sengta a, Israelte tunga atapate gamtatdan teng leh kimutuona biehbuh kot zunga nasem numeite ana luppi dante uh ana zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akung uah,” Bangdinga hichibang silte na bawl uh ahiei? Mizousie a kipat in na gamtat hoiloute uh kana za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ta lawm! ka tapate aw! na tungtang uh kana zahte ahoilou lam ngen ahi. Mangpa mite na takhiel sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khat midang tunga akhel leh Pasian in thu akhen pieh ding, hinanleh mi Mangpa tunga akhel leh koiin thu anget pieh ta diei? ‘achi hi. Hinanleh Mangpa’n amaute tha atup ziehin apa uh thupiehte asang nuom tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n naupang Samuel khu ahing khanglien deudeu a, Mangpa leh mihingte deisah in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian mi khat Eli kungah ahing pei a, akung ah Mangpa’n tambang in agen hi, “Izipt gam a Pharaoh Inn a, aum laiun napu napate uh kungah kichien tahin ka kilah sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel namzousie lah a lienpen in ka maitam a gim namtui halding leh ka masang a siempu puontuol sil dingin ama ka teldoh hilou ahiai mah? Tualeh na pa innkuonpite kungah Israel tate a pat a mei a sillat zousie kapieh hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangdinga ka tenna a ka kithoina ding leh sil lat dinga thu kana piehte na peh gawp a, ka mi Israelte sillat zousie ahoipente a, kivahthau dinga, kei sanga na tapate zatatzaw na hiei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Israelte Pasian in; keima ngelin na innkuonte leh napa innkuonte zousien kumtawnin ka masang ah nna nasem dinguh ka chi ngei ngut a, achi hi, hinanleh tuin vang Mangpa’n kei a kipat in kikhinmang un; Kei hing zatat te khu ka zatat dinga, tualeh Kei hing simmaw te khu Ken zong ka simmaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngaiin, na ban thahatna te, napa innkuonte ban thahatnate ka tansan ni hing tung ding ahita, na innsung ah teh kun a dam mawngmawng aum sih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mite Pasian in hausatna zousie apieh hun chiengin ka umna inn ah melma khat na hing mu dinga, tualeh na innsung ah tehsie a dam mawngmawng kumtawn in aumsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh na mi, ka maitam a kipat a ka satkhiet louding pen khu na mittang vaidou hitui suohna leh na lungkhamsahpen ahi dinga na innsunga hing pieng poumate khangdawng in ashi zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khumin na tapate Hophni leh Phinehas tunga hing tung ding khu nanga dingin chiemtena ahi dinga, nikhat thu in ani un ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu muonhuoitah keima dingin ka tungdoh dinga aman ka lungtang leh ka lungsim toh kituoh in nna asem ding, ama khu inn kiptah in ka siem dinga, tuachi’n ka sathaunu masang ah kumtawn in nna asem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, na innsunga adamsun tapou khu, dangka leh tanghou ngen in akuon ding ua, tanghou themkhat beeh ka neh thei na dingun siempu nna khat hing sem sah dive, achi ding hi, achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naupang Samuel in Eli nuoi ah Mangpa nna asem a, khum hunlai in Mangpa thu akikhaat mama a, alangtanga kilahna a um zepzep sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hun laiin hichi ahing hi a, Eli a umna mun a alup lai in amitte ahing miel panta a khuo amuthei mang nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian bawm umna Mangpa biehinn a meivah ami masangin Samuel khu imut sawm in alum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n “Samuel ahan ta a,” tualeh aman “Tanah ka um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Eli kungah ava tai a, akung ah “Tanah ka um hi, na hing han a,” achi hi. Hinanleh aman “Kahing hankha sih hi, vaki lup ta’n,” achi hi. Tuachi’n apei a alumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n “Samuel” chi’n ahankia a, tuachi’n Samuel thou doh kia in Eli kungah avapei a, “Tanah ka um hi, nahing han a,” ava chizel hi; hinanleh aman akung ah, “Kahing hansih hi, valum kia ta’n” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum hun laiin Samuel in Mangpa athei naisih a, tualeh Mangpa thu zong akungah akiphuongdoh nai tadi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n athumvei na in Samuel ahing han kiata hi. Tualeh Samuel athou a, Eli kungah avapei a, akung ah, “Tanah ka um hi, na hing han a,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Eli in Mangpa’n naupang khu ahat ahi chi atheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Eli in Samuel kungah, “Pei inlen valum ta’n, tualeh ahing hat kia a ahileh, “Mangpa thugen in, na suoh in angai khie hi,” na chi in, achi hi. Tuachi’n Samuel apei a alupna mun ah alumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa ahing pei a, ahing dinga, ahat ngai bangin, “Samuel! Samuel!” chi in ahing han kiata hi. Aman zong “Thu genin na suoh in a ngaikhie hi” achi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Samuel kungah, “Ngaiin, Israel gamah aza pouma bil langni ua bil ap huoi khop in silkhat bawl ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum ni chiengin, a innkuonpite tungtang thu kanagen zousie abul a kipat in atawp dong in Eli tungah ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atapaten Pasian agensietna khelna uh thei zing napi a akhaamlou ziehin a innsung khu kumtawn a dingin gawtna toh vai ka hawm pieh ding hi, chi’n kana hil zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Eli innkuonte kungah, Eli innkuonte gitlouna khu kithoina ahiei, sillat ahiei in bangchih tanin zong siemtangsah nawnsihvang chi’n ka kichiemta hi.” Achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel khu zingmawng dongin alum a, tualeh Mangpa inn kot khahte khu ahong a, tuachi’n Samuel in khum kihilna khu Eli hil ding azauta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Eli in Samuel ahan a, “Samuel ka tapa” achia, tuachi’n aman zong, “Tanah ka um hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Bang ahiei Mangpa’n na kung a agen? Ka kungah bangma imsin; na kung a agen zousie ka kunga im nanei leh na tungah Pasian in alaw law hinglaw tahenlen, khum sanga thupi zaw in zong bawlta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in im neilou keei in abawn in ahilsieng keei a, tuabep in aman “Ama khu Mangpa ahi, pha asah bang bangin bawlta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel ahing khanglien deudeu a, tualeh Mangpa’n ama a umpi a, athugente mawngmawng tuol ah akemangsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Dan a kipat Beersheba dongin Israelte zousien Samuel khu Mangpa guolnei dinga namdet ahita chi ana theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa khu Shiloh ah akilah kia a, Mangpa khu Shiloh khuo ah Samuel kungah Mangpa thu in akilah toupeh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel thu khu Israel mizousie kungah athangkheta hi. Tuachi’n Israelte Philistin mite dou dingin akuonta ua, Ebenezer gei ah panmun abawl ua, tualeh Philistin miten Aphek ah panmun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistinte khu Israelte doudingin, akiguol ua, ahing kidou tahun Israelte khu Philistinten azouta uhi. Kidouna phuol ah galkap tul li vel athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh mipite giehphuol ahingtun tahun, Israel upaten “Bangzieh a tunia Mangpa’n Philistin mite masanga ang guollelsah ahiei? I lah ua a um a igalte lah a kipat ahing hundam theina dingin tua Pasian thuhun bawm khu Shiloh a kipat va pokhe vai achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten Shiloh ah mi asawl ua, Cherubim tegel kikaal a um galkapte Mangpa thuhun bawm khu avalata uhi, tuachi’n Eli tapa tegel Hophni leh Phinehas tua mun ah Pasian Thuhun bawm toh aum ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Thuhun bawm khu agiehphuol ua ahingtun tahin Israelte zousie leithuong kihawt zenin akikouta uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistin miten akikou husa uh azah tahun Hebrute giehphuol a kikou thawmging vengvung khu “Bang chidan ahiei le, akichituo uhi;” khumin agiehphuol ua Mangpa bawm tung ahita hi chi athei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mite khu azau ta mama ua, “Pasian giehphuol ah ahing tung hi” achi ua ama un itung agih hi, “Nidangin tambang sil apiengkha naisih hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itung uh agih hi, tam tha hattah pasiente khut a kipat ahing hundoh ding koi ahiei? Tam pasiente khu ahi, Izipt mite gamdai a, natna chi tuomtuom a thatliate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aw nou Philistin mite aw, nasuoh leh sal ua a um bangun, noute Hebrute suoh leh sal a na umlou na dingun hattah in um unlen, kipasalsah unlen, kihantawh kawm in dou un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin miten adou zel ua, Israelte khu azouta ua, mizousie apuon inn lam chiet uah ataizahta uhi; kithana thupitah ahia, tualeh Israel galkap tul sawm thum ashi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian bawm khu alahpieh ua, tualeh Eli tapate gel Hophni leh Phinehas zong athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin mikhat alutunga lei bang nianua leh apuonsil eehtelsa nemnom pi’n akidou na phuol ua kipat ahing tai a, khum ni main Shiloh ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amapa ahing tun tahin, Eli in lamgei a touna tung khat a touin; Pasian bawm ziehin lungsim chitun kawm kawm in ana en ngitnget hi. Tualeh tam pasalpa khopi sung ahingtun tahin thu umdan zousie agen leh khopi sunga mizousie akikou zahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Eli in mikikou husa azah tahin tua thawmging vengvung khu “Bang chidan ahiei?” achia, tualeh tua pasalpa kintahin ahing pei a, thu zousie Eli ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eli khu kum sawmkuo leh kum giet a upa ahita a, amitte amielta a, khuo zong amuthei nawnsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua mipan Eli kungah, “Keima kidouna phuol a pat a hing pawtdoh a, tunia kidouna phuol a kipat a hing taidoh ka hi,” achi tahi. Tualeh Eli in, “Ka tapa gal kidouna bang asuoh tai?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n thu hing tut pan adawng a, akung ah, “Philistin mite masang ah Israelte ataizahta hi, tualeh kithana thupitah mipite lah ah aum nalai a, na tapa tegel Hophni leh Phinehas zong ashita ua, Pasian Thuhunbawm zong ahing kilah pieh ta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing ahia, Pasian thuhun bawm thu ahing genkhah tahin kotgei a atouna a pat in athalpua a, angawng atawng a, ashita hi, tehsie leh gihtah ahi ziehin. Tualeh aman Israelte tungah kum sawmli vai ana hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh amounu Phinehas zi in nau apai a, anau nei ahun mamata hi, tualeh amanu’n Pasian bawm alata uh chi leh a innpipa leh apasal ashita chi thu azah tahin, anauvei in atut ziehin akunsuh a, nau aneikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ashi ding kuon a akunga ding numeiten akung ah, “Zausin tapasal na neita hi,” achi ua, Hinanleh amanu’n adawng tasih a, angaisah tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khumin “Thupina in Israel ataisanta hi,” chi’n tua naupang min dingin Ikabod aphuah ta hi, aziehkhu Pasian bawm alah pieh ta ua, a innpipa leh apasal lah ashitah ziah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n “Pasian thuhun bawm ahing kilah mangpieh tah ziehin thupina in Israel ataisanta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistinten Pasian bawm alata ua, Ebenezer apat in Ashdod khuo ah ahing tutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Philistinten Pasian bawm khu ala ua, Dagon umna innsung ah ahing polut ua, Dagon kungah akoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Ashdod khuo a mite zingmawng matah a ahingthaw u’leh, Mangpa bawm masang ah Dagon lim khu bohkhup in tuol ah ana pua hi. Tuachi’n Dagon khu ala ua a umna mun ah atungkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh azingni zingmawng matah a athaw u’leh ‘En in’ Dagon khu akhup in tuol ah Mangpa bawm masang ah ana pua kia a, tualeh Dagon lutang leh khutphang tegel akitanbongsa in kot phung ah ana um a, Dagon pumpi maimai ana umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Dagon siempute leh Dagon biehinn a hing pei zousien Ashodod khuo a Dagon kotphung khu tuni dongin atuon ngam nawnsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khut khu Ashodod khuo ah mizousien athuohlaw ta a, sietna atungsahta a, Ashodod khuo leh agam sunga mizousie, uilut natna in agawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Ashodod khuo a umte’n sil umdan ahingthei tahun, “Israelte Pasian bawm ikung ua a umlou ding hibou, aziehpen Pasian khut khu itung uah leh i pasien Dagon tungah ithuohla sengta uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Philistinte vaihawm zousie akung uah ahankhawm sah ua, akung uah “Israelte Pasian bawm khu bang ilaw diei?” akichituo uhi. Tualeh amaute’n “Israelte Pasian bawm khu Gath khuo lam ah vakoi ta un chi’n” adawng uhi. Tuachi’n amaute’n Israelte Pasian bawm khu Gath khuo lam ah avakoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahinghi a, apeipi zou tahun, Mangpa khut in tua khopi tungah sietna nasatah atungsahta a, tua khopi sunga mite alien aneu uilut natna hii atung uah atungsah tahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute’n Pasian bawm khu Ekron khuo ah athahdohta uhi. Tualeh Pasian bawm Ekron khuo ahingtun in, Ekron miten “Ei leh imite thatlia dingin Israelte Pasian bawm ikung uah ahing tutta uhi,” chi’n akikou zahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Philistin vaihawmte hankhawm dingin mi asawl ua, akung uah “Eite leh imite ahing thalia louna dingun Israelte Pasian bawm khu hakhedoh unlen, a umna mun ngaima ah va koikiata un,” aziehpen khuo pumpi a mi zousie manthaina khop a shina in buoigawpna a umta hi. Pasian khut lah tua khuo tungah agih mama hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ashi loute zong uilut in atuom a, tualeh tua khopi a mihingte kikou husa in van athawnta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian bawm khu Philistinte gamsung ah hasagi aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Philistinten siempute leh aisan siemte ahankhawm ua, “Mangpa bawm khu bang ilaw ding uoi? A umna ngai ah bang toh ka hakhe ding uoi?” Hing hil un, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun “Israelte Pasian bawm na hahkhiet ding u’leh zong aguoh in hakhesih un; ahithei tan in akung ah khelna kithoina lan teitei un, tuachi’n damsah in na um ding ua, tualeh bang ding a akhut khu na tung ua kipat a ladohlou ding ahiei, chi na thei ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama un Akunga, “Tatsietna kithoina sillat a kapieh ding uh khu bang ahi diei?” achi uhi. Amaute’n “Philistin vaihawm milien phazat toh kituoh in, uilut lim a kibawl sana nga leh sansim lim a kibawl sana nga bawl un, tua natna khu noute leh na vaihawmte zousie uh tunga leng hii khu khat ahizieh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin na uilut lim u’leh na gam uh susetu sansim limte bawl unlen, tualeh Israelte Pasian kungah thupina pia un, tuachi’n na tung u’leh na pasien u’leh na gam sung uah akhut ajangsah ut khamaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pharaoh leh Izipt miten alungtang uh akhausah bang ua bangdinga na lungtang uh khausah nahi uoi? Alah ua sil lamdangtah bawl in a mite apeisah ua, akikhenpi ta uh hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin, tuin bawngleng tha khat bawl unlen bawngpi ni anawi kisuh lai, angawng a hahkol kivawkha ngainailou; tua bawngpi tegel ngawng ah bawngleng khu vaw unlen, tuachi’n anoute khu inn lam ah kaikia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa bawm khu la unlen, bawngleng tungah khang unlen; tualeh Mangpa kunga khiel kithoina dinga na silpiehte uh, sana limte khu singkuong sungah thun unlen, Pasian bawm pangah koi unlen; tuachi’n hakhie unlen, peisahta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuchia agamlam uh lampi zui a, Beth-Shemesh zuon in apei naimah? chi en un, apei a ahileh itung ua sil hoilou tah hing tung khu Ama bawl ana hi ding a; apei sihleh eite hing gawt khu Ama khut ahisih hi chi ithei ding ua, itung ua hing tung kha maimai ahiding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten tuachibangin abawl ua, bawngpi anawi suhlai ni ala ua, bawngleng ah avaw ua, anoute khu inn ah akhum chipta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa bawm khu bawngleng tungah sana a kikheng sansim lim leh uilut limte kikoina singkuong toh akhang khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n bawngpi tegel Beth Shemesh lam zuon in lampi tang taha zuiin ham kawm kawm in apei ua, zietlang ahiei veilang ahiei ah zong apiel vawt sih uhi. Philistin vaihawmten Beth Shemesh gamgi dong azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beth-Shemseh khuo a mite phaijanga bu la-a aum’ lai un, adahtou u’leh Pasian bawm khu amu ua, akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawngleng khu Beth Shemesh khuo a um Joshua loulai ah ahinglutta a, suongpi lien khat umna mun ah adingta hi; tualeh bawngleng singte khu asut ua, Mangpa kunga halmang kithoina dingin bawngpi tegel alanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Levi miten Mangpa bawm leh sana leh silmanpha umna singkuong khu alakhie ua, suongpi lien tungah akoi ua, tualeh Beth-Shemesh khuo a miten khumni main halmang sillatte leh kithoina sillatte, Mangpa kungah alanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuakhu Philistin vaihawm lien nga ten khumte amu zou un, tuani main Ekron ah aki nualeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistin miten sana a kikheng uilut lim Mangpa kunga khiel kithoina dinga alatte uh khu tamte ahi; Ashdod khuo mite a dingin khat, Gaza khuo mite a dingin khat, Ashkelon khuo mite a dingin khat, Gath khuo a mite a dingin khat, Ekron khuo a mite dingin khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh sana a kibawl sansim lim khu, khopi kulpi nei leh singtang khoneute zousie sim in Philistin vaihawmlien nga te khoneiza ahi. Mangpa bawm angahna uh suongpi mama khu Beth Shemesh khuo a teng Joshua loulai ah tutan in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa bawm sung a et ziehun Beth Shemesh khuo a mite agawt a, mi sawmsagi athat a, tuachi’n Mangpa’n mi tampi thalia ziehin amauten asuunta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuazouin Beth-Shemesh khuo a miten “Asiengthou Mangpa Pasian masang a ding ngam ding koi ahiei? tualeh ikung ua kipat in koi kung ah ipeisah diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kirjath-Jearim khuo a mite kungah thangkou ding mi asawl ua, tam bangin “Philistin miten Pasian bawm khu ahing paw kiata uhi, hing pei suh unlen hing kilahta un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kirjath-Jearim khuo mite apeisuh ua Mangpa bawm alatou ua, singtang a um Abinadab Inn ah atutta ua, atapa Eleazar Mangpa bawm kemtu dingin asusiengthou ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hia, Kirjath-Jearim khuo a Pasian bawm a umsung khu sawtpi ahia, kum sawmni sung ahi, tuachi’n Israel innkuonte zousie’n Mangpa alamnai kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Israel innkuonte zousie kungah, “Na lungtang zousie u’toh Mangpa kunga hing kinuale nahi u’leh, gamdang pasiente leh Ashtorethte nalah ua kipat in paimang unlen, nalungtang uh Mangpa a dingin kisa kholsah unlen, Ama nna bou sem un; tuachi’n Philistin mite khut a kipat ahing hunkhe ding hi,” chi’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Baal leh Ashtaroth akoimang ua, Mangpa nna bou asemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in “Israel mi zousie Mizpah ah hing kikhawm unlen, Mangpa kungah nouma dingin thu ka hing ngetpieh ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mizpah ah ahing kikhawm ua, tui atawi ua, Mangpa masang ah asungkhie ua tuamun ah tuani in ann a ngawl ua, “Mangpa tungah ina khielta hi,” achi uhi. Tualeh Samuel in Mizpah ah Israel tate tungah vai ahawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistinten Mizpah khuo ah Israel mipite akikhawm uh chi azah tahun, Philistin vaihawm liente khu Israelte dou dingin akuonta uhi. Tualeh Israel taten tua thu azah tahun Philistin mite agiing ta mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Samuel kungah, “Philistin mite khuta kipat a ahing hundam thei na dingin, Mangpa i Pasian uh kunga na kikou khu khawlsan vawtsin” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Belamnou nawinelai khat ala a, halmang sillat in apum in Mangpa kungah alanta hi. Israel mite a dingin Samuel in Mangpa ahan a, tuachi’n Mangpa’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in halmang sillat alatlai tahin, Philistinten Israel doudingin ahing nai deudeu ta uhi. Hinanleh tuani in Mangpa’n Philistinte tungah vanpi ngai tahin aging sah a, tuachi’n a amzahta ua, tualeh Israelte masang ah aguollelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mite Mizpah a pat in akipankhie ua, Bethkar khuo dongin Philistin mite anuadel ua, athatgamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in suong khat ala a, Mizpah leh Shen kikal ah aphut a, “Tamtan chieng Mangpa’n ahing panpi hi” chi in amin dingin Eben-ezer achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mite anuoisieta ua, Israel gam ah ahing nualut kia nawn tasih uhi; tualeh Samuel damsung tengin Mangpa khut in Philistin mite adou zing ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Philistinten Israelte khuo alahpieh zousiete uh Ekron a kipan Gath tan in, Israelten Philistinte khut a kipat anualah kia uhi, tualeh Amor mite leh Israel kikaal ah zong kilemna ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in adamsung tengin Israelte tungah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in kumchin in Bethel, Gilgal leh Mizpah, khuote ave zel a tua khuote a kipan Israelte vai ahawmpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh atenna khuo Ramah ah ahing pei kia zel a tuamun ah Israelte vai ahawmpieh a, tualeh tuamun ah Mangpa a dingin maitam khat abawl hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahinghi a, Samuel ahingteh bep in atapate Israelte tungah vaihawm in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atapa tahpen min Joel ahia, aninapa min, Abijah; ahi. Amautegel in Beer-Sheba ah vai ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh atapaten ama umdan azuisih uhi; gin umlou tahin sum leh pai asui ua, golguhnate ala ua, thudih khu alengatsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel upate zousie ahing kikhawm ua Ramah khuo a Samuel kungah ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh akung ah, “En in, natehta a, na tapaten lah na umdan azuisih ua, namdangte bangin ka tung ua vaihawm ding leeng khat hing guot pieh in” achita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh akung a, “Vaihawm ding leeng khat hing pie in” achi thu un, Samuel alungkimsah tasih hi. Tuachi’n Samuel Mangpa kungah athumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khumin Mangpa’n Samuel kungah, “Mipiten na kung a agen zousie khu zui in; nangma ahingdeilou zieh uh ahi sih a, atung ua leeng a um dingin, keima hing nuol ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat a kapuidoh ni a kipat tuni dongin asil bawldan zousie uah ahing lengatsan ua, pasien dangten nna ahing sepsan zel uh mabangin nangma tungah zong abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin tu’n, athu uh ngaikhie inlen, ahivangin atung ua vaihawm ding leengpa gamtatdan ding chientah leh guntah in akung uah hilchien masa in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Mangpa thu zousie leengpa ngen mipite kungah ahilchien ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman “Natung ua vaihawm ding leengpa gamtatdan dingte tambang ahi ding hi; natapate uh sakol leh asakolleng hawl ding leh atunga tuong dingte aguot ding a, sakolleng masang a taiding mi zong aguot ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh galkap tul khat tunga lamkai ding leh sawm nga tunga lamkai ding, kim khatte aloukai ding leh abu at ding in akoi dinga, kimkhat te kidouna galvante kheng ding leh sakolleng bawl dingin apang sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman na tanute uh gimnamtui siemding leh ann huonding, tualeh tanghou bawl dingin azang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman nalou hoipente uh, na grep huonte u’leh na olive huon hoi penpente uh ahing lahpieh dinga, a suohte kungah ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman nabu leh balte uh leh na grepte uh sawma khat ahing lahpieh dinga, asuohte leh alamkaite uh kungah ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman na suohpate u’leh na suohnute uh na tangval mel hoipente u’leh na sabiltungte uh ang lahpieh ding a, ama nna asemsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na Belam honte lah a a sawma khat ahing lahpieh dinga, tualeh noute asuoh in napang ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh khum hun chiengin nouma ngelin na tel uh, leengpa ziehin nakap ding ua, hinanleh tuahun chiengin Mangpa’n ahing ngaikhe sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh mipiten Samuel thugen khu adeisih uhi; amaun “Hilou e, ka tung ua vaihawm dingin leeng khat ka nei ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n koute zong nam dangte bangin ka leengpa un ka tung uah vai ahawm dinga, tualeh ka masang ua peiin ka galte uh ahing doupi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in mipite zousie thugen khu angaikhie a, Mangpa kungah atutsawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Samuel kungah, “Athugen uh ngaikhiet pieh inlen leeng khat bawlpieh in” achi hi. Tuachi’n Samuel in Israel mite kungah, “Mizousie nouma khopi chiet ah peita un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin gam a, Benjamin mi mihat leh hangsan mama khat a um a, amin Kish ahi; tuakhu Abiel tapa ahia, tuakhu Zeror tapa ahia, tuakhu Bekorah tapa ahia, tuakhu Aphiah tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman tapa khat aneia, amin Saul ahi, tangval deihuoitah leh melhoitah ahi. Israel tate lah ah ama sanga duong ching leh melhoi koima aum sih hi: aliengkou sanga sang zaw koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Saul pa Kish Sabiltungte amanga, Kish in atapa Saul kungah, “Hepitahin kisa inlen suohte khat pui inlen Sabiltungte va suita vawi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Ephraim singtang gam leh Shalisha gam atuon suoha, hinanleh amu sih uhi. Tualeh Shaalim gam zong ava tuon suoh ua amu sih uhi. Tualeh Benjamin mite gam ava tuon suoh ua, hinanleh amu zou tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuph gam ahingtun tahun, Saul in azawpi asuohpa kungah, “Hingpeiin nua kiata maivai akhuchi sih leh ka pa’n sabiltungte ngaituo nawnlou in eitegel hing na lunggimpi zaw tava,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh asuohpa’n akungah, “Ngaiin, tam khuo ah Pasian mikhat a um a, mizatat huoitah ahia, agen zousie ahing tung teitei zel hi, kisa in khunah va haw vai, ipei nading lampi ang hil thei khamaw sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in asuohpa kungah, “Ahina a en in, vahaw talei tua mipa adingin bang ipuoh diei? Ithungpi sunga itanghou puohte lah abeita a, tua Pasian mipa ipieh ding bangma a um nawnsih hi, bang inei nalai ei le?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh asuohpa’n Saul adawng kia a, akungah, “En ve, Dangka Shekel khat se li sua sekhat tanah ka nei nalai hi, ipei nading lampi ahing hil man dingin Pasian mipa ka pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Nidang laiin Israelte lah ah, min Pasian adoh nop chiengun, tambangin achi uhi, “Hingpei vawi, Mutheipa kung ah vahaw tavai” achi ua, aziehpen tulai a guolnei kichi khu masang laiin Muthei ana chi uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in asuohpa kungah, “Hoi e, vahaw tavai leh,” achi a, tuachi’n Pasian mi umna khuo ah ava hawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khopi lam zuona muol langa apeitou laiun, nungah hon khat tuitawi dinga hingkuon amu ua, akung uah, “Mutheipa tanah a um ei?” chi’n adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh amaun um mah e, “En un, na masang uah apei hi, kinaw un; tuni’n mipiten mun sanga kithoina anei zieh un tam khopi ahing haw ahi, chi’n adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khosung na lut lut chiengun, munsanga ann nedinga apeitou masanga, nava mupai ding uh ahi. Tua kithoina khu ama’n aguolzawl masah ding ahi, ziehin; amapa hing tun masangsie’n mipiten ann ane sih ding uhi, tua zou chiengin amichielte un aneding uhi. Tuaziehin peitou meng un, hichi hun laitahin ama nava mupaiding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi ah apeitou ta uhi, tualeh khopi sung alut laitah un, munsanga peitou ding, amaute lam zuon a hing pei Samuel toh akituoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul va pei masang nikhat aumlai in Mangpa’n Samuel kungah ana genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Zingchieng tuhun laitahin, Benjamin gam akipat mikhat ka hing sawl ding a, nangman amapa khu ka mi Israelte tunga vaihawm dingin sathau na nu ding ahi, Philistin mite khut akipat ka mite ahundam theina dingin; akikouna aw uh ka kunga ahing tuntaah ziehin, ka mite ka ngaisahta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in Saul amutah in, Mangpa’n akungah, “En vawi, na kunga kana genpa, amapa’n ka mite tungah vai ahawm ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Samuel khu kelkot ah ava zuon a, akungah, “Hepitahin hing hil in, Mutheipa inn heisung ahiei?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in Saul adawnga, akungah, “Tua Mutheipa khu keima ka hi; munsang tandongin ka masangah pei inlen, tuni’n ka kungah ann na ne ding hi; tualeh zing chiengin ka hing peisah dinga, tualeh na lungsim a um zousie zong kang hil sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ni thum masanga na sabiltung mangsate tungtang thu ah lung himaw nawn sin, akimuta hi. Tualeh Israelte lunggul zousie koi tunga um ding ahiei? Nang leh na pa innsung mite ading hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in adawnga akungah, “Israel namte lah a neupen Benjamin nam a mi kahi sih amah? tualeh ka innkuon sung u’zong Benjamin innkuon zousie lah a, aneupen ahi sih amah? Bangchidan a kei kunga tambang thute na gen ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Saul leh asuohpa azawpi a, michiel tuomte pindan sungah apuilut a, misawm thum vel chieltuom a umte dinga mun zatathuoi ah atou sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in annhuonpa kungah, “Na kunga koituom ding chia, ka hing pieh khu hing tawi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n annhuonpa’n amal leh atunga um khu ahing tawi a, Saul masangah ahing lui a. Tualeh Samuel in “En vawi, ka hing tuom koi pieh khu na masangah akiluita hi, Nein; mi kana chiel khawmta hi, kachi ni akipat a, tutan a ana kikoituom khu ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Saul in khum ni in Samuel toh ann anekhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Munsang akipat a, khopi sung ahing peisuh un, Samuel in ainn tungah Saul ahoupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zingmawng matah in athou ua, ni suoh ding kuon velin Samuel in “Inntung langah Saul ahan a, kisa in ka hing pei sahta ding hi” a chi hi. Tuachi’n Saul adingdoha, tualeh Saul leh Samuel, ani un pulam ah apawtdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuabanga khogei lam a apeisuh laiun, Samuel in Saul kungah, “Suohpa khu masa sahin achia (tuachi’n amasa ta hi). Hinanleh nangpen tanah khawltadi inlen, Pasian thu ka hing theisah theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in sathau bawm khat ala khie a, Saul lutungah asunga, atawpa, akungah, “Mangpa’n agoutante tunga vaihawm dingin sathau ahing nu hilou ahiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tunia ka kunga kipata na peidoh chiengin Benjamin gam leh Zelzah gamgi a Rachel han gei ah, mi ni na kituohpi dinga, tualeh amaun na kung ah, sabiltung na suite khu akimuta hi, tu’n napa’n sabiltungte alung khampi nawn sih a, “Ka tapa bang ka lawta diei?” chi’n nangma ahing lunggimpi zawta hi, achi hi, ahing chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuamun akipat in na mailam uah na pei zel ding ua, Tabora Gangpi sing phung na tung ding ua, khum mun ah mithum Bethel a Pasian kunga haw dingten ahing kituohpi ding ua, khat in kelnou thum apodinga, khat pen pa’n tanghou beuthum, tualeh adang khat penpa’n uoin savun thawl khat apo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaun ahing chibai ding ua, tualeh tanghou beu ni ahing pe ding ua, tua khu akhut uapat nasang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuazou Chieng in Philistin galkapte umna Gibeah a Pasian muol na tung ding ua, tualeh hichi ahi ding a, khuo na tun kuon chieng un, guolnei hon khat mun sanga kipata hing pei suh, amasang ua, pehging, khuongta, theile leh kaiging tumte na kituohpi ding ua, amauten thu mavang agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Hagau na tungah ahing tung ding a, tuachi’n nang zong amautoh, thu mavang na gen khawmta dinga, tuachi’n mituom na hing suohta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tam chiemtenate na tunga ahing tun chieng in, sil hing umdan dungzui zel a, na bawl ding ahi, Pasian in ahing umpi ding zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka masangah Gilgal ah na haw masa inlen; tualeh, kei zong halmang sillatte leh lemna kithoina sillatte, lan dingin, na kungah ka hing pei ngeingei ding hi, ka hing pei masangsie nisagi tan nang na ngah dinga, tuachi’n na bawl ding ka hing hil ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh hichibang ahing hi ngut ma a, Samuel peisan dinga anuangatsan laitah in, Pasian in lungtang tuom apeta hi. Tualeh tua chiemtena zousie khum ni mama in atung siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul leh asuohpa Gibeah muol ahing tun tahun, guolnei honkhat in Saul ana kituohpi ua; tuachi’n Pasian Hagau atungah ahing tunga, tuachi’n aman zong alah uah thumavang agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, tumasanga ama na theisaten, guolneite lah ah thumavang gen in apang chi amu tah un, mite khat leh khat akihou ua, “Kish tapa tunga sil hing tung khu bang chidan atai leh?” Saul zong guolneite lah ah pangta hi maw? akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh khuna teng mi khat in adawnga, “Apate uh koi ahi uoi?” achia, “Tuaziehin Saul zong guolneite lah a khat ahita amah?” chi khu paunah khat ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in thumavangte agen zou in, munsang ah apeitou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Saul paneu in Saul leh asuohpa kungah, “Heilang a vahaw nahi uoi?” achia, tuachi’n aman a kungah, “Sabiltung vasui kahi ua, tualeh ka muzoulou tahun Samuel kungah kava hawta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul paneu in akungah, “Samuel in na kungah bang ahiei agen, hepitahin hinghil in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in a paneu kungah, “Sabiltungte akimuta hi chi chientahin ahing hil hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh leenggam tungtang Samuel in agente ahil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in mipite Mizpah khuo a Mangpa kungah ahankhawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate kungah, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Israelte Izipt akipat in ka puidoh a, Izipt mite khuta kipat leh nouma nuoisie taha hingbawlgenthei leenggam zousiete khut a kipat in ka hing hundoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh tunia na gentheina zousie u’leh na chimawna zousie ua hing hundohpa na Pasian uh na dei nawn sih ua, akungah leengkhat hing bawl piehin nachi zawta uhi. Tuaziehin tuin anam anam leh aphung aphung in Mangpa masang ah hing kilang un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in Israel nam zousie ahing kilat sah zouin, Benjamin nam khu teldoh ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin namte a innkuon, ainnkuon a akilatsah laiin, Matri innkuon tel in aumta hi. Tualeh Kish tapa Saul khu telin aumta hi, tualeh ahing suitah un amuzouta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa adong kia ua, “Tua mipa khu tamlangah ang pei kha ei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa’n adawnga, “Amapa khu vanlom lah ah akibu hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n atai ua ava puidohta uhi, tualeh mipi lah a ahing din leh mite lah ah asang pen a, koima aliengkou sanga sangzaw a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in mipi zousiete kungah, “Mangpa miteldohpa khu na mu uoi? mipite zousie lah ah amabang koima aum sih uhi,” achi hi. Tualeh mipi zousie akikou ua, “Pasian in leengpa humbit hen,” achi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in mipite kungah, leenggam um danding ahil chienta a, tualeh laibu sungah agiel a, Mangpa masangah akoita hi. Tuachi’n Samuel in mipite ainnlam chiet ua peidingin asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Saul zong Gibeah khuo a ainnlam zuonin apeita hi. Tualeh mihangsan Pasian in alungtang uh akhoi pieh ten zong azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh mi-hel leh gilou koite ahieiin, “Tam mipa’n bang ahing chi hundam ding adiei?” achi ua, tuachi’n amapa asimmaw ua, tualeh kipahman silpieh zong apenuom sih uhi. Hinanleh amapa asip khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ammon mi Nahash ahing kuontou a, Jabesh-Gilead dou dingin giehphuol ava sat khuma, tualeh Jabesh-Gilead mite zousie’n Nahash kungah, “Ka kung uah kilemna thuhun bawl inlen, tuachi’n na nna ka semding uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Ammon mi Nahash in amauh adawnga, akung uah, “Tambangin noute toh kilemna thu hun ka bawl ding hi, Na mit zietlam zousie uh ka kheikhe dinga; tuakhu Israel nam pumpi a dingin minsietna ahi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jabesh khuo a upaten akungah, “Israel gamsung pumpi a thangkou ka sawltheina ding un ni sagi hing na hungaitadi in, tuazou chieng a, koute hing hundam ding koima a um sih leh nangma kungah ka hing kipelutna ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n thangkou asawlte uh Saul umna Gibeah khuo ahing tung ua, tualeh mipiten abil ua azahna ngel ua tua thute agen tahun; mipite aw ngaitah a kikou in akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh, lou akipat in bawnghon nua ah Saul bawng hawl in ahing pei a, tualeh Saul in “Bang achi ua ahiei mipite ahichi ka uh?” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaun Jabesh khuo a mite thugen ahil ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in tam thu azah tahin, Pasian Hagau atungah ahingtunga, tuachi’n hatangpi’n alungthahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n bawngtal kop khat agou a, asa asem nena, Israel gamsung zousie ah thangkoute ahawm sah a, akung uah, “Koipou kidouna a Saul leh Samuel nua zui utlou pouma, abawngtal uh tambanga bawl ding ahi achi hi;” Tuachi’n Mangpa giinna khu mipite tungah ahing tuta a, pum khat banga kithutuoh in ahing kuondohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul in Bezek khuo a, ama uh asim leh Israel mite tul zathum apha ua, Juda mite tul sawmthum apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun thangkou hing peite kungah, “Jabesh Gilead a umte kungah tambangin na gen ding uhi, zingchieng nisat sanlaitahin, hundoh nahi ding uh, vachi un,” achi ua, tuachi’n thangkoute ahing pei ua, Jabesh mite ava hiltah un, ana kipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jabesh miten Ammon mite kungah, “Zing chiengin na kung uah ka hing kipelut ding uhi, tuachi’n ka tung ua hoi nasah bangbang un bawl mai un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n azingni in hichi ahing hia, Saul in mipite khu hon thumin akhen a; tualeh zingmawng galven hun laitahin agiehphuol sung uah alut ua, Ammon mite khu sun nisa ham laitah dongin athat uhi. Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, ahing sunte zong akithezah sieng ua, mi ni a umkhawm mawngmawng in zong a nua sieta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten Samuel kungah, “Saul in itung ah vai ahawm na ngel diei chi khu koi ahiei? Tua mite hing kaikhie in ka that ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul in “Tuni’n koima tha ahi sih ding, aziehpen tuni’n Mangpa’n Israelte lah a hundamna abawlta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in mipite kungah “Hing pei un, Gilgal ah iva hawding ua, tuamun ah Lenggam ibawl tha ding uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi zousie Gilgal ah ava pei ua, tualeh Gilgal a Mangpa masangah Saul khu leeng in abawlta uhi. Tua mun ah amauten Mangpa masangah lemna kithoinate alan ua, tualeh tua mun ah Saul leh Israelte zousie akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Samuel in Israel mi zousie kungah “Ngaiun, ka kunga nagen zousie uh ka hing bawl piehta hi, tualeh na tung ua leeng ding zong ka hing guot piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh, tu’n, leengpa’n na mauh akaita hi, keipen ka tehta a ka sam zong a kaangta hi, tualeh en un, ka tapate zong na kung uah aum uhi, tualeh ka neu lai apat tuni tandongin na lamkai un ka pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un tanah ka um hi, Mangpa leh asathau nupa masangah hing niel un, koi bawngtal ahiei ka lahpieh ngai? ahisihleh koi Sabiltung kalah pieh ngai ei? koi kabawl genthei ngai ei? Ahisihleh ka mit tawsah dingin koi khuta kipat ahiei golguhna ka lah? ka hing din sieng kia ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akungah, “Nang sol ngai sih a, nang bawl genthei sih a, koima khut akipat in lahtuohlou zong nala ngai sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Ka khut ah bangma kilawmlou namu sih uh chi tuni’n Mangpa na lah uah atheipipa ahi a, asathau nupa zong tuni’n atheipipa ahi,” achi hi. Tualeh amaun, “Ama atheipipa ahi” chi’n adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in mipite kungah, “Mosi leh Aaron teldohpa leh Izipt gam a kipata napu leh pate uh puidoh pa khu Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin ding khinkhian un, Mangpa masang ah, na tung u’leh napu leh pate uh tunga Mangpa’n sil dihtaha ana bawldante zousie ka hing sutpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt gam a Jakob alut nua in, napu leh pate un Mangpa ahan ua, tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi leh Aaron asawl a, amaute gel in Izipt gam a kipat in napu leh pate uh ava puidoh ua, tualeh tammun ah ateng sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun Mangpa a Pasian uh amanghil ua, tuachi’n Aman Hazor galkap lamkai Sibera khut ah leh Philistin mite khutah tualeh Moab leengpa khut ah azuata a, tualeh amauten adou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute Mangpa han in akikou ua, Mangpa ka taisanta ua, Baal leh Ashtorethte nna kana sep tah zieh un, sil kabawl khielta uhi, hinanleh ka melmate uh khut akipat in hing hundoh inlen, tuachi’n Nangma nna ka semta ding uhi, achi u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Jerubaal bang, Barak bang, Jeptha bang, Samuel bang asawl a, tualeh munchin a na galte uh khut akipat in ahing hundohta a, tuachi’n bittahin na umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Ammonmite leengpa Nahash noute dou dinga hingkuon namu tahun, ka kungah, Ahisih, ka tung uah Lengpa’n vaihawm zaw heh, nachi ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh na leengpa uh hina piin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin en un, na lunggul bang ua na teldoh pa uh leeng, tanah aum hi, tualeh ngaiun Mangpa’n leengpa ahing bawlpiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa giindan na siem ua, anna nasep ua, athu na man ua, tualeh Mangpa thupiehte dou a, na kiphin sih u’leh, tuachi’n noute na tung ua vaihawm leengte leh Mangpa na Pasian uh thu zuite nahi ding ua, ahoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa thu na ngaikhieh sih ua, Mangpa thupiehte na helsan ua, na kiphin u’leh, napu leh pate un, Mangpa khut athuoh mabangun noute’n zong na thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin ding khinkhian unlen, Mangpa’n na mitmu ua, sil thupitah abawl ding khu en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuni khu bu lahni hilou ahiei mah? Mangpa ka han dinga Aman van ging leh guo ahing sawl dinga, tuachi’n leengpa na ngetna thu uah, Mangpa mitmu a sil na bawl khelna uh thupidan, nathei ding ua, tualeh namu ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Mangpa ahan a, tualeh khum niin Mangpa’n van ging leh guo asawl a, tuachi’n mipi zousien Mangpa leh Samuel nasatah in agiing mama ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh mipite zousie in Samuel kungah, “Ka shi louna dingun Mangpa na Pasian kungah, na suohte thu hing nget pieh mengin, tam sil hoiloutah leengpa kana ngetna ziehun ka gitlouna uh ka belap sawn sawnta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in mipite kungah, “Zau sih un, tam silgilou zousie nana bawlta ngutngei uhi, hinanleh Mangpa na zuina ukhu pielsan tuom sih unlen, na lungtang zousie un Mangpa nna semzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kinepna ding bangmalou leh nou hing hundam theilou zui in pielsan sih unlen, phattuomna neilou ahi ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amin thupitah ziehin Mangpa’n lah amite alengatsan sih dinga, noute Ama mi dinga bawl khu Mangpa kipahna lamtah ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuathamlouin noute dinga kathumnate tawpsan in Mangpa tungah ka gamta khiel sih dinga, hinanleh lampi hoi leh dih ka hing hil zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa giindan siem phot mai unlen, na lungtang zousie un chitah leh muonhuoi tahin Ama nna sem unlen, noute dinga silthupi abawldante ngaituo zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh giloutah a, na bawl nahlai lai u’leh noute na leengpa uh pumin phietmang in na um ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul kum sawm thum ahiin vai ahawm pan a; Tualeh Israete tung ah kum ni vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in Israel mi tul thum ateldoha, tul nite khu Mikmash leh Bethel singtang gam a Saul kung ah aum ua, tualeh tul khatte pen Banjamin gam a Gibeah ah Jonathan kungah aum uhi, tualeh adang zousie khu apuon inn lam chiet uah anua sawl kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in Geba a Philistin galveng mite panmun ava sim a, tuakhu Philistin miten ana za ua. Tuachi’n Saul in “Hebru miten naza uheh” chi’n agam pumpi ah pengkul amut sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte zousie in Saul in Philistin galvil galkapte asim chi leh Israelten zong Philistin mite huot in aum uh chi thute ana zata uhi. Tuachi’n mipite Gilgal ah Saul kungah akikai khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mite khu Israelte dou dingin akikhawmta ua, Sakol tul sawm thum, sakol tung tuong tul guh leh galkapmi tuipi pieu a senel bang mai a tam ahi uhi. Tualeh akuontou ua, Beth-Aven apata nisuona lam panga, Mikmash mun ah panmun akhaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Israel galkap miten imchimit ahita uh chi akitheitah un (mipite achimaw mama hi) tualaitah in mipite leihawm sungah, lingnoh lah ah, Suonghawm lah leh suongpi pang lah pou ah, akibuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Hebru mi lawikhatte khu Jordan gal a Gad leh Gilead gam ah atai ua, Saul pen Gilgal ah aum a, tualeh mipi zousie’n chitun pum in ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in aguotsa hun bituh dungzui in nisagi Saul in ana ngah a, hinanleh Samuel Gilgal ah ahing peita sih hi, tuachi’n mipiten Saul ataisan siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Saul in “Halmang sillat leh lemna sillat khu ka kungah hing tawi un,” achia, tuachi’n ama’n halmang sillatte alanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, halmang sillatte alatzou tahin ngai in Samuel ahing tunga, tuachi’n ama vadawn ding leh chibai buh dingin Saul apawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in akungah “Bang ahiei nana bawl?” achi hi. Tualeh Saul in “mipiten ahing taisan uh chi ka thei a, tualeh nanglah na nichiem sunga na hing tunlou zieh in, tualeh Philistin mite lah Mikmash ah akikhawm uh chi ka thei ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Philistin miten Gilgal a hing kuon suhin hing dou ding ahita ua, ken lah Mangpa kungah, deisahna ka ngen naisih a, tuaziehin bawllou theilou in ka kingaituo a, halmang sillat kana lanta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in Saul kungah, “Mot huoi tahin sil na bawlta hi. Mangpa na Pasian thu pieh, nangma ahing thupieh na zui sih hi. Mangpa’n Israelte tunga na lalna kumtawn a suhdet tum hi maven izaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh tu’n vang na leenggam atawpta ding hi, Mangpa’n thu ahing pieh na zuilou ziehin. Mangpa’n Ama lungtang bang puo mi asui a, tualeh Mangpa’n ama khu amite, tunga vaihawm dingin aguotta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel adingdoh a, Gilgal a kipat in Benjamin gam a Gibeah khuo ah apeitouta hi. Tualeh Saul in akunga mipi umte asimleh, zaguh vel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Saul leh atapa Jonathan leh akunga umte Benjamin gam a Gibeah khuo ah a um ua, hinanleh Philistinten Mikmash ah pan mun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mite giehphuol akipat in galbawl mite pawl thumin ahing kuon ua, pawl khat in Shual gam a Ophrah zotna lampi azuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh pawl dang khat in Beth Horon zotna lampi azui ua, tualeh pawl dang khatten gamdailam toh kinai Zeboim phaijang kimuna gamgi lampi zuiin apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel gamsung pumpi ah sia kheng mawngmawng koima a um sih uhi, aziehkhu Philistin miten, “Hebru miten namsau ahiei, teipi ahiei, abawl kha ding uh” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel mi zousiein, alei laina uh khenchi heipi leh atupite uh taat hiem dingin Philistinte kungah ahaw suh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh khenchi leh tupite khenman khu Shekel sethum suosekhat ahia, tualeh heipite khenman leh ze zang man khu Shekel sethum suo sekhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin kidou ni ahing tun tahin, Saul leh Jonathan kunga um mipite khut ah, namsau leh teipi khat zong aumta sih hi. Hinanleh Saul leh atapa Jonathan in tuate anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin galkapte Mikmash phaihawm ah apawtdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh ni khat khu hichi ahing hia, Saul tapa Jonathan in agalvan puo tangvalpa kungah, “Kisa in, gallang khat a Philistin galkapte umna ah iva pei ding hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh apa ahil sih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Saul khu Gibeah pulam a Migron mun a kolbuthei sing nuoi ah atou a, akunga galkap umte khu zaguh vel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Shiloh khuo a Mangpa siempu Eli tapa Phinehas tapa Ikabod sanggampa Ahitup tapa Abijah zong siempu puonahtuol silin a um hi. Hinanleh Jonathan akuonta chi mipite koiman athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in Philistin galkapte panmun a va peisuh atupna guom leh guom kikaal alang tuoh ah suongpi sangtah a um tuoh a, khat min Bozez ahia, tualeh adang khat pen min Seneh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kawl suongpi khat khu Mikmash toh kigalsai, mallam a um ahia, suongpi dang khat pen Gibeah toh kigalsai simlam, a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in agalvan tawi tangvalpa kungah, “Hing pei vawi, tam teptanlou galkapte umna ah vahaw tavai, Mangpa’n ei a dingin sil hingbawl pieh khamawlou ding hi, Mangpa ading in tam leh tawm thuin hundamna adal tuom sih hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n agalvan tawipan akungah, “Na lungsim a um bang tahin bawl in, en in, keima na kungah ka um hi, na lungsim bang bang ka puo hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in, “Ngai vawi, akung uah iva galkai dinga, iva kimu sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaun ikunga, Na kung ua ka hing pei masang sie uh hing na ngahun achi u’leh, i umna mun ah ding khinkhian vaiin, akung uah vapei davai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kung uah hing peitou un achi u’leh, iva peitou dinga; Mangpa’n amaute ikhut ah ahing pie hi chi ei a dingin chiemtena ahi ding” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute gel zong ani un Philistin galveng mite ava kimu sah ua, tualeh Philistin miten “En vawi un, Hebru mite akibutna uh leikohawm akipat in ahing pawldohta uhi,” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n galveng galkapten, Jonathan leh agalvan tawipa ahan ua, ka kung uah “Hing peitou unlen, sil khat ka hing ensah ding uhi,” achi ua. Tualeh Jonathan in agalvan tawipa kungah, “Hing zui in Mangpa’n amaute Israelte khut ah apekheta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan akhut leh keng toh pangin akaltou a, agalvan tawipa’n azui hi, tualeh amaute Jonathan mai ah apuata ua, tualeh agalvan tawipa’n anua ah athat zuizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jonathan leh agalvan tawipa’n atha masah chiil un lou chiing kimkhat sungah mi sawmni vel athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkapte zousie tung ah buoi na ahing tunga, giehphuol sung leh kidouna phuol a umte tualeh galveng mite umna mun leh galbenga kuon galkapte nangawn leh mipite zousie chitun in akiling siengta ua. Tualeh leitung zong zil akilinga; tuachi’n chitutna leh kilinna nasatah ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin gam a Gibeah muna Saul galveng miten ana en ua, tualeh ngaiin, mite azun in azunkhe zeng zung ua; lelam lelam ah akiphutuo niai nuai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in akunga um mite kungah, “Tuin kisim unlen, ilah uah koi ahiei kimlou um, en un” achi hi. Tuachia ahing kisim u’leh ngaiin, Jonathan leh agalvan tawipa ana umta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Ahijah kungah, “Pasian bawm tam langah hing la un” achi hi (khum hunlai in Israel tate toh Pasian thuhun bawm aum khawm hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Saul in siempupa ahoupi zing laiin, Philistin galkapte giehphuol a buoina husa a huoise semsem a, Tuachi’n Saul in siempu kungah “Nakhut nua kai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul leh akunga mipi um zousie akikhawm ua, kidouna mun ah avapei ua; tualeh ngai vawi, Philistin galkapte zousie amauleh amauh khat lekhat namsau a kisattuo, buoina chizat huoi tah um khu ava muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, tumasang lai a, khum gam a na um Hebru mite, Philistinte panpi a, agiehphuol ua va umte na ngawn zong, Saul leh Jonathan kunga um Israelte lamah alepanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuamabangin Ephraim singtang gam a kiphuol Israel mite zousie’n zong Philistin mite ataizahta uh chi ana zahtahun, amaute zong kidouna a pangin hadel in ava nua delta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n khum niin Israelte tuabang in ahundohta hi, tualeh Beth-Aven dongin akidou ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh khum niin Israel mite alungdong mama ua, Saul in lah ka galte tunga phu kalah zou masangsie’n “Nitah lam donga koizong ann ne aumleh hamse sawngin um heh,” chi’n mipite avau hi; tuachi’n koiman ann mawngmawng achiem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh mipi zousie gam lah ah atungta ua, tualeh lei lah ah khuoizu ana uma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh mipite gamlah ava tun tahun, ngaiin khuoizu ana tahkhie hi, hinanleh koiman akhut in akhoi sih uhi, aziehpen mipiten tua kichiemna khu agiing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Jonathan in apa’n mipite kungah vauna thuchiem abawllam athei sih a; tuachi’n akhut a achiengtawi mongin khuoiphang adawt a, khuoizu khu aneh leh amit ahing vahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite lah a khat in akungah, “Napa’n khautah a kichiem in mipite avau a, Tunia ann ne penpen hamse sawngin um heh,” achi hi; tualeh mipite zong abasamta mama uhi achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh Jonathan in, “Ka pa’n gamsung abuoi sah bep hi. En un, tam khuoizu themkhat kachep ziehin kamit hoitahin avahta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mipiten agallah silte uh tuni’n a ut ut un nethei hita mai u’leh, bangzata a thupi leh nasazaw ahita diei? Tuazieha Philistin mite nasataha that theilou law ihita ve uoh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khum niin Israel taten Mikmash akipat in Aijalon dongin Philistin mite adou ua, tualeh mipite zong aba mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten agallah silte uh abawin abawthaw ua, belamte, bawngtalte leh bawngnoute aman ua, tualeh tuol ah athat ua, mipiten asisantoh ane thopta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Saul ahilta ua, akungah, “En in, mipiten sisan toh aneh ziehun Mangpa tungah anamta khielta uhi,” achi uhi. Tualeh aman “Lepchietah in na gamta ua, Tuni’n ka kungah suongtum lienpi khat hing lia un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in “Mipi lahah vah zah unlen akung uah, michin in abawngtal u’leh abelam uh, ka kungah hingkai u’henlen, tammun ah gou u’henlen, ne u’heh, asisan toh ne khawmin Mangpa tungah gamta khiel nawn sih un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n mipite zousiein abawngtal uh khumi zanin ahingkai chiet ua, tuamun ah agouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Mangpa adingin maitam abawl a, tuakhu Saul in Mangpa dinga abawl masah pen maitam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in, “Zan chiengin Philistin mite iva nuadel suh ding ua, zingmawng khovah tandong in gallah sil i vala ding ua,” tualeh pasal pouma ihinkhawi mawngmawng sih ding uhi, achi hi. Tualeh amaun “Hoi nasah bangbangin bawlin,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n siempupa’n “Tam mun ah Pasian nai tadivai” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Pasian adonga, “Philistin mite doudingin kava kuon suh diei? amauh Israelte khut ah na pedoh diei? achi hi. Hinanleh tua niin Pasian in adawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in, Nou mipi lamkaite zousie hing peikhawm di uo, tualeh tuni’n tam khelna khu bangpen tah ahiei chi thei khiet tum unlen, en vawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aziehpen Israelte hundampa ahinzing bangin, ka tapa Jonathan ahizongin ashi teitei ding ahi,” achi hi. Hinanleh mipite lah a koiman athugen adawng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Israel zousiete kungah, “Noute langkhat ah atuom in um unlen, kei leh ka tapa Jonathan langkhat ah ka um ding uhi,” achi hi. Tualeh mipiten Saul kungah “Hoi nasah bangbangin bawlin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaziehin Saul in “Israelte Mangpa Pasian kungah, Adihtah hing sulangin,” achi hi. Tualeh Saul leh Jonathan tungah atu a, mipite pen a awngtangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in “Kei leh ka tapa kaal ah aisan un” achi hi. Tuachi’n Jonathan tungah atua, amankheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Jonathan kungah, “Bang ahiei na bawl hing hil in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Jonathan in ahilta a, akungah “Ka khut a ka chiengtawi mongin khuoizu neu khat ka chiemkha ngut hi, tuaziehin ka shi ding ma ahi” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in adawnga, “Pasian in alaw law hing law henlen, tua sanga nasa zaw in zong: Na shi ngei ding ahi, Jonathan,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanleh mipiten Saul kungah, “Israelte lah a tambanga hundamna thupitah bawlpa Jonathan ashi thei mawh diei mah? shi vawtlou ding, Mangpa ahinbangin, alutunga samzang khat zong tuol ah akesih ding hi. Aziehpen tuni’n Pasian toh nna asem khawm hi,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n mipiten Jonathan ahundoh ua, tualeh ashita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Philistin adel khu anuakia santa hi. Tualeh Philistin mite zong amauh munlam ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul Israelte tungah leeng in apanga, tualeh ningchin tenga gal zousie, Moabte, Ammon mite, Edommite, Zobah leengte, tualeh Philistin mite toh akidou a. Tualeh anawhna lam pouma azou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh galkapte akhawma, tuachi’n Amalekte adoua tualeh amauh doute khut akipat in Israelte ahundoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tualeh Saul tapate khu, Jonathan, Ishvi leh Malkishuah ahi ua. Atanu upa pen min khu Merab, ahia, anaupang zawnu min khu Mikal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh Saul zi min khu Ahinoam, Ahimaaz tanu ahia; tualeh agalkap lamkaipa min khu Saul paneu Ner tapa Abner ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh Kish khu Saul pa ahia, tualeh Abner pa Ner khu Abiel tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Saul damsungteng Philistin mite toh kidouna zauhuoitah aum zinga, tualeh Saul in pasal hat leh hangsan amu pouma amatoh pang khawm dingin ala zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kungah, “Mangpa’n ami Israelte tunga leeng hidinga, nangma sathau nu dingin ahing sawl hi. Tuaziehin tuin Mangpa thugen awte ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Israelte Izipt gam a kipata ahing pei lai ua, Amalek miten lamkaal lah a ana lamtaan ua, abawl sietnate ziehun, tu’n keiman ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu’n vakuon inlen, Amalek mite va sim in, tualeh anei zousie uh khawi neilou in sumang sieng inlen, Numei, pasal, naungeh leh nawi nelaite, tualeh bawngtal leh belam, tualeh sangawngsau leh sabiltungte abawn in that gam siengin, achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in mipite ahankhawm a, Telaim khuo ah asim a, galkap tul zani leh Juda mi tul sawm apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Saul Amalekte khopi khat ah ahing tunga, tualeh guom ah ana buh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Kenmite kungah, “Hing pawtdoh unlen Amalek mite akipat kihem khie un, tuachilouin vang amaute toh ka hing that khawm kha ding hi, Aziehpen Israelte Izipt gam a kipata ahing peilai un nouten Israel tate zousie tungah na hepina uh nana sulang uhi.” Tuaziehin Kenmite khu Amalekmite lah a kipat in akihemkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Amalekmite khu Havilah akipat in Izipt gam nisuona lam a um Shur dongin adouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Amalekte leengpa Agag khu ahingmat a, tualeh mipite zousie namsau hiem in athatgamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul leh mipiten Agag ahinkhawi ua, Tualeh belam hoi penpente, bawngtal hoi penpente leh athau thaute, belamnoute tualeh sil hoi zousie athatgam ut tasih uhi. Hinanleh pannabei leh adeihuoiloute zousie athatgam sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Samuel kungah ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saul leenga kana pansah ka kisia mama hi, Kei hing zui nawnlouin ahing nuangatsanta a, tualeh ka thupiehte bangin abawlsih hi,” achi hi. Tualeh tam thuin Samuel a lunggim sah a, zantungtawn in Mangpa ahanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel khu Saul kimupi dinga zingmawng matah a athaw laiin, “Saul Karmel muol ah ahaw a, tualeh ngaiin, khunah theizingna suong aphut a; tualeh akinuale kia a, apei zel a, Gilgal ah apei suh ta hi,” chiin Samuel ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel, Saul kungah ava haw a, tualeh Saul in akungah “Mangpa’n hing guolzawl hen, Mangpa thupieh kava bawlzouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Samuel in “Ka bil a belam ham ging leh bawngtal hamging ka zahte khu bangchidan ahiei leh?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in “Amalekmite a ahing lahpieh uh ahi; Mangpa na Pasian kunga kithoina dingin, mipiten belam hoipen pente leh bawngtal hoipenpente akhawi ua; adangteng athatgam sieng uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Saul kungah, khawl tadi vawi! Mangpa’n zani zan a ka kunga agen khu ka hing hilding hi, achi hi. Tualeh Saul in hing gen ve, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in, Nangma ngaiin mi neunoukhat hinanlachin zong, Israel nam pumpi lutang hilou na hiei mah? Tualeh Mangpa’n Israelte leengpa dingin sathau ahing nu hilou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa’n nang nna khat semdingin ahing sawlkhie a, na kungah, kuon inlen Amalek migilou haw, thatgam sieng inlen, a unpi ua amanthai masangsie uh dou zel in, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangdinga Mangpa thu manglou a, gallah silte, abaw a na bawthaw a, Mangpa mitmu a sil hoilou na bawl ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Samuel kungah, “E! Mangpa thu ka zui vele, Mangpa’n ahing sawlna ah ka pei a, Amalek leengpa Agag ka hingmat a, tualeh Amelekmite ka thatgam siengta hilou ahiei amah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh mipiten thagam ding hinazenpi, gallah sil belamte, bawngtalte, sil hoi penpente, Gilgal a Mangpa na Pasian kunga kithoina dingin ala uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in: “Mangpa’n, Mangpa thuman a kipahpi bangin, Kithoi na leh halmang sillatte akipahpi a mah? Ngai in kithoina sangin, thuman ahoizaw a, Belamtal thaute sangin, thuzui ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen helna khu ai san siemte gitlounatoh kibang ahia, Thuman louna khu, sil bawl khiel na leh milim biehna khelna toh kibang ahi. Mangpa thu na deilou ziehin, Ama’n zong leengpa dingin ahing dei nawn sih hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Samuel kunga, “Kana khielta hi, Mangpa thupieh leh nangma thute kana palsanta hi; mipite ka giin ziehin athu uh kana zuikhata hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, hepitahin ka khelna hing ngaidam inlen, Mangpa ka bieh theina dingin hingkinuale pi kia in chi’n kahing ngen hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Samuel in Saul kungah, “Mangpa thu na nuol ziehin ka hing kinualepi sih ding hi, tualeh Mangpa’n Israelte tunga leenga pang dingin ahing nuolta hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel peidinga akihei laitahin Saul in apuontuol mong atuh leh akehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in akungah, “Tuni’n Mangpa’n Israel leenggam nanga kipat in alakheta hi. Nang sanga hoizaw na innveng kungah apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Israel thupina Pasian azuou sih dinga, alungsim zong akhel sih ding hi. Lungsim khel dingin Ama mihing ahisih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in “Kana khielta hi, hinanleh ka mite upate masang leh Israelte masanga hing pahtawi hamham nalai dingin ka hing ngen hi. Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian ka bieh theina dingin hing kinualepi kia teitei in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Saul akinuale pi kiata a, Saul in Mangpa abeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in “Amalek leengpa Agag” ka kungah hing zawpiin, achi a, tuachi’n Agag akungah chitun pumin ahing pei a, tualeh Agag in “Shina kha tah pel hita vang emaw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Samuel in, “Na namsau in numeite ta neilou a akoi bangin, nanu zong numeite laha ta neilou in aum ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Samuel in Agag khu Gilgal a Mangpa masang ah atenbuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel Ramah khuo ah apeita hi. Tualeh Saul zong a inn langah, Gibeah khuo ah apeitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in ashi ni dongin Saul kung pha in akimupi nawn sih hi. Hinanleh Samuel khu Saul ziehin akap ngitnget hi. Tualeh Israelte tunga leeng dinga Saul ana pansah ziehin Mangpa akisia mama hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Samuel kungah, “Israel mite tunga vaihawm dinga ka deinawnlousa Saul zieh a bangtan vei kap ding na hiei mah? Na saki sungah sathau thundim inlen kuon in, Bethlehem mi Jesse kungah ka hing sawl ding hi; atapate lah a mi khat leengpa dingin ka guot zouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in, “Bang kachi kuon thei mawh diei? Saul in na za leh ahing” that ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah “Bawngla khat kai inlen, Mangpa kunga kithoi dinga hing pei kahi, na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh kithoina ah Jesse chiel inlen, tuachi’n na bawl ding ka hing ensah ding hi: tualeh amin ka hing hilpenpa khu keima dingin sathau hing nu pieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in Mangpa gen bangin abawl a, Bethlehem ah ava hawta hi. Tualeh khuo a upaten chitun kawmin ama ana dawn ua akungah, “Lungmuonna toh hing pei na hina amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Lungmuonna thutoh Mangpa kunga kithoi dinga hing pei ka hi, kisusiengthou unlen, kithoina ah hing hing haw un,” achi hi. Tualeh aman Jesse leh atapate asusiengthou a, kithoina a dingin achielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, ahing pei tahun, Eliab ana en a, “Mangpa sathau nupa pen amasanga umpa ahi ngeingei ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n Samuel kungah, “Amel ahiei asanlam ahiei en sin, ama ka deisih hi, Mangpa’n mihing et bangin a en sih hi, mihing ten pulam mel puoh danin a en ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n lungtang sunglam a en zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesse in Abinadab ahan a, Samuel masang ah apei sah hi. Tualeh aman “Tami Mangpa’n atel sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesse in Shammah apeisah kia a, tualeh aman “Tampa zong Mangpa’n atel naisih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabangin Jesse in atapa sagite Samuel masangah apeisah a, Tualeh Samuel in Jesse kungah, “Mangpa’n tam mite atel sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in Jesse kungah, “Na tapate aunpi un tanah aumkimna uh amah?” achia, tualeh Jesse in “Atumpen aum nalai hi, tualeh ama pen belam ching ahi,” achi hi. Tualeh Samuel in Jesse kungah, “Mi sawl inlen vahan sahin, ahing tun masangsie tou lou ding ihi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi ava hansah a, amapa ahing puilut ua. Ama khu asan thiutheu, mit haa kilawm leh melhoitah ahi. Tualeh Mangpa’n “Dingdoh inlen sathau nuin; tam mipa ngel ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel in sathau koina saki ala a, asanggamte lah ah ama sathau anuta hi; Tualeh khum ni apat in Mangpa Hagau David tungah atungta hi. Tuachi’n Samuel adingdoh a, Ramah khuo ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa Hagau in Saul a pawtsanta a, tualeh Mangpa sawl hagau gilou khat in Saul asubuoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Saul suohten akungah, “Ngai in, Pasian hing sawl hagau gilou in nang ahing subuoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin kapu un na masanga um na suohte thu hing pie inlen tumging tumsiem mikhat sui sahin; tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Pasian sawl hagau gilou na tunga ahing um chiengin, aman tumging khu akhut in atum dinga, tuachi’n nadam ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in asuohte kungah, “Tumging tum siemmi khat hing sui pieh unlen ka kungah hing pui un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuohte khat in adawnga, akungah, “En in, Bethlehem mi Jesse tapa khat ka mu a, amapa khu tumging tumsiem, mihangsan, galdou siem, thugen siem tualeh mel hoitah ahia; akung ah zong Mangpa a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Saul in Jesse kungah mi asawl a, “Na tapa David belam chinga um khu ka kungah hing sawl in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Jesse in sabiltung khat, tanghou leh uoin savun thawl khat leh kelnou khat ala a, Saul pieh dingin David aposah a, Saul kungah asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Saul kungah ahing tunga, tualeh amasangah ava dingta a, tualeh Saul in ana it mama a, tuachi’n agalvan puoin apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Jesse kungah mi asawl a, “David ka kungah umdenta heh, ka mit atung mama hi,” achi sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, Pasian akipat a hagau gilou khu Saul tunga aum chiengin David in tumging ala a atum zel hi, tuachi’n Saul ahing dam zel a, tuachi’n hagau gilou in Saul apawtsan zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin miten kidou dingin agalkapte uh akaikhawm ua, tualeh Juda gam sunga Sokoh khuo ah akikhawm ua, tualeh Sokoh leh Azekah kikaal a Ephes Dammim mun ah panmun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Saul leh Israel mite zong akikaikhawm ua, tualeh Elah phai ah panmun abawl ua, Philistin mite dou dingin akiguoldimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mite khu alang khat a muol tung ah apang ua, tualeh Israelte khu alelamgal muol tung ah apang ua, akikaal uah phaijang khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mite panmun akipat in mihat mama khat amin Goliath Gath khuo aum, asan lam tong guh leh khap khat, ahing pawtdoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman sum-eng lukhu akhu a, sum-eng awmphaw asil a, tualeh a awmphaw gihdan shekel tulnga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh a ngal ah sum-eng ngal tuomna abun a, tualeh aliengkoutegel kikaal ah sum-eng teipi apuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ateipi bul khu siemkol bang ahia, tualeh ateitong khu agihdan shekel zaguh ahia, tualeh a phaw popa amasang ah apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n adinga Israel galkapte lam ngain akikou a, akung uah “Bang dinga, kidou dinga hing kiguoldim nahi uoi? Kei Philistin mi, noute Saul suohte nahi sih uoi mah? Mikhat hing kiteldoh unlen ka kungah hing peisuh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei ahing ki buonpi theia ahing tha zou leh na suoh un ka um ding ua, hinanleh ken ka zaw a ka tha zou leh ka suoh un na um ding ua, ka nna uh nasem ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tuni in Philistin mipa’n “Israel galkapte ka tawh ahi, mikhat hing kuon sah un,” kana kisatpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul leh Israelte zousie in tua Philistin mipa thugen azah chiengun, alungkie ua, azau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh David khu Juda gam a Bethlehem khuo a teng Ephrathmi Jesse tapa ahia, Jesse in tapa giet anei a, tualeh ama Saul vaihawm hun laiin, ateh ta a, akum zong atamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Jesse tapa upa pente thumin kidouna ah Saul nua azui ua, tualeh kidouna a kuon atapa thumte min, a upa pen Eliab, azom in Abinadab, tualeh athumna khu Shammah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David khu nautum ahia, a upapen thumte’n Saul azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh David khu apa belamte kem dingin Saul kunga kipat in Bethlehem ah ava pei zelzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Goliath in ni sawm li sung, zingmawng leh nitah tengin, ava nai a, ava kitahlang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesse in atapa David kungah, “Tam butang kikanggaw ephah khat leh tanghou beu sawm na ute dingin puo inlen agiehphuol uah manlangin va pei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tami bawngnawidat beu sawm galkap tul khatte tunga lamkaipa dingin puo inlen, tualeh na ute bang achi na uoi mah, va en inlen, atanchin uh theina dingin bang ahiei khat hing tawi in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuin amaute Saul leh Israel mizousiete toh Elah phaijang ah Philistin mite toh kidou dingin a um uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n David zingmawng matahin athoua, belamte khu aching mi khat akemsaha, Jesse thu pieh bangin avante apuo a, apeita hi. Tualeh galkapte kidou dinga kuonkhie a, akikou vapual laitah un David giehphuol ah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israelte leh Philistin mite khu kidou dingin alang alang ah akiguol dim ua, galkap leh galkap a kimaituota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in avan puohte khu van kempa khut ah anuasie a, galkapte kungah ava tailut a, a ute bang na chi na uoi chi’n ava dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachia ahoulim laitah un, ngai in, Philistin galkapte lah a kipat in Goliath kichipa Gath khuo a Philistin mi, ami hatpa uh ahing pawtdoh a, agen ngaiteng ahing genkia a, tuate David in anaza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mizousien tua mipa amutahun ataizah ua, azau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel miten, “Khuna hing kuontou mihingpa na mu ei? Israelte tawh dinga hingkuon tazing ahi, tualeh hichi ahi ding a, koipou ama that zou a umleh, leengpa’n hausatna thupi tahin ahausa sah dinga, atanu toh akitengsah dinga, tualeh apa innkuonte Israel gam sungah anuom lensah ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akunga ding mite kungah, “Tam Philistin mipa that a Israelte minsietna lamangpa khu banglaw ding adiei? Tami teptanlou Philistin mipi koi ahi phuata, Pasian hing galkapte tambanga atawh mawngmawng ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten tambangin adawng uhi. “Koi zong ama that pouma, ka gen bang ua bawl ahi ding,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mite kunga athu gen khu, a ute lah a upapen Eliab in ana za a, tuachi’n Eliab khu David tungah alungthah a, David kunga “Bang zieh a tana hing peisuh na hiei? Tualeh gamdai a belam tawmnoukhat umte khu koi kunga nahing nuasie ahiei? Na kiletsahna leh na huot huoina ka thei hi, gal kidou ending a hing peisuh nahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh David in “Bang ahiei ka bawl? Azieh a um sih amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman midangte lam ngain akiheisan a, tualeh agen ngaiteng agen a, tualeh mipiten amasang a adawn bangun adawng kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh David thugente azah bep un, Saul kungah ava gen sawnta uhi. Tualeh Saul in David ahansah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Saul kungah, “Ama ziehin koima lungke sih heh, na suohpa kava kuon dinga tam Philistin mipa kava kisuolpi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in David kungah “Nangpen Philistin mipa dou dingin kuon theisih vateh, khangdawngnou nahi nalai a, amapen aneu apat a, kidou mi ahi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh David in Saul kungah, “Na suoh in ka pa belamte ka chin laiin, humpibahnei ahiei, vompi ahiei ahing pei a, belam honte lah akipat belamnoute ahing tawdoh chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka nuadel a, ka satlia a, akam apat in belamnoute ka hundoh zel hi, tualeh keima suol dinga ahing thawdoh chiengun abah ah kamana, ka satpua a ka that zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na suohpa’n humpibahnei leh vompite ka thata, tualeh tam teptanlou Philistin mipa zong tuate mabangin a um mai ding hi, Pasian hing galkapte atawh phuat a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuathamlouin David in “Humpibahnei chin hiemleh vompi chin hiem akipata hing hunkhe zel Mangpa’n tam Philistin mipa khut akipat ahing hundoh ngei ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Saul in David kungah, “Kuon in, Mangpa na kungah umta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in agalthuomte David asil sah a, alu ah sum-eng lukhu akhusah a, a awmphaw zong a sil sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh David in agalvan tungah namsau akuo a, peipi dinga akisah leh apei theita sih hi. Aziehpen ama khumbangin akivonngai sih hi, Tuachi’n David in Saul kungah, “Tamteng ka vahpi thei sih hi, tambang in kana ki von ngainai sih hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n David in asutkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n achieng tawi khu ala a, luita suongtang zol kilkel nga atawm a, abelam chinna thungpi sung ah aguong hi, tuachi’n asaili a tawi a, Philistin mipi khu ava zuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mipa khu ahing pei a, David lam ahing zuonta a, tualeh agalvan tawipa amasangah apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mipa’n dah kawikawi in ahing en a, David a mu tahin tangvalnou san thiutheu melhoitah ahi ziehin asimmaw mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mipa’n David kungah, “Ui ka hiei mah? chieng tawi a ka kunga nahing pei,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Philistin mipa’n a pasiente min lou in David ahamsiet ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mipa’n David kungah, “Hing pei in, nasa tunga leeng vate leh gamsaten ka nesah ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Philistin mipa kungah, Nang namsau teipi leh lum leh phaw toh nahing kuon a, hinanleh kei pen galkapte Mangpa, Israel galkapte Pasian na tawhpa Ama min in ka hing kuon hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa’n nang ka khutah ahing pe dinga, ka hing satlia dinga, nalu katan dinga: tualeh Philistin galkapte luongte khu tunga leeng vate leh gamsate kane sah ding hi; tuachi’n leitunga um mi zousie’n Israelte lah ah Pasian aum hi chi athei ding uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh tammun a kikhawm zousie’n Mangpa’n namsau leh teipiin koima ahundam sih chi athei chiet ding uhi, aziehpen kidouna khu Mangpa a ahibou hi, Tualeh aman noute ka khut ah ahing pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Philistin mipa adingdoh a, David dou dinga ahing zot tahin, David zong galkapte langah Philistin mipa doudingin, a naw tai chinten ta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akhut in athungpi sung asawh a, suongtang khat alakhie a, akap leh Philistin mipa talpang akha a, asuong atal ah atum a, tuachi’n akhupboh in tuol ah apua helhul ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuabangin David in Philistin mipa khu saili khat leh suongtang khat in azouta a, Philistin mipa asat a athat ta hi, hinanleh David in namsau atawi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuaziehin David atai a, Philistin mipa tungah adinga, anamsau ala a, apai apat adohkhie a, tua namsau in alu atan a athatta hi. Tualeh Philistin miten ami hatpa uh ashita chi amutahun ataizah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mite leh Juda mite adingdoh ua, akikou ua, tualeh phaijang lutna leh Ekron kulpi kotkha tandong Philistin mite anuadel ua. Tualeh Philistin mi gal a liemte Shaaraim lam tungtawn ah Gath leh Ekron dongin apua lemlum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate Philistin mite nuadel, ahing kinuale ua, apuon innte uah gal vanlah neitah leh sum leh pai avala uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />David in Philistinpa lutang ala a, Jerusalem ah apuo a, agalvante pen puonbuh sungah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saul in David khu Philistin mipa dou dinga akuon khieh amu tahin, galkap lamkai Abner kungah, “Abner tam tangval pa koi ta ahiei?” achi hi. Tualeh Abner in akungah, “Na hinna louin kagen ahi, Aw leengpa ka thei vawt sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tualeh leeng pa’n “Tam tangvalpa koita ahiei chi kandoh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuachia Philistin mipa that zou a David ahing kinuale kia tahin, Abner in ama ana zawpi a, akhut a Philistin mipa lutang tawi pum in Saul masangah alutpi tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Saul in David kungah, “Tangval koi tapa na hiei?” chi’n adonga, tualeh David in “Bethlehem mi na suohpa Jesse tapa ka hi,” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, Saul kunga thu agenzou tahin, Jonathan hinna leh David hinna ahing kizopta a, tuachi’n Jonathan in ama hinna a it bang in David a it ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuami ni mama in Saul in David a umpi paingal a apa inn lam ah apei sah nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in ama hinna a it bang a David a it ziehin thuhun abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in apuonahtuol sillai asutkhie a, agalvante, anamsau, athalpi leh akawnggah nangawn toh David apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in asawlna pou ah David apei zel a, pilvang tah in agamta hi. Tualeh Saul in ama khu agalkapte tunga vaihawm in apangsah hi. Tualeh mi zousie mitmu leh Saul nasemte mitmu in zong pahtat leh kipahpi in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, David in Philistin mipa that zou, mipi innlam zuon a ahing kile kia ua inn lam zuona ahing pei laiun, Israel khopi zousie akipat in numeite ahing pawtdoh ua, lasa a lam kawm in khuongta leh sil gingtheitengtoh nuomsatahin leengpa Saul dawn dingin ahing pawt ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh numeite alam kawm un akikhieng tuo ua, “Saul in a tul a tul in athat a, David in a tul sawm a tul sawm in athat hi,” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tambanga ala sahte un Saul alungthah sah mama ta a, alungkim ta sih hi. “David tul sawm that in angai ua, kei atul atul giap that in ahing ngai uhi, leenggam atan ding chilou bang ahiei aum nalai achita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuani akipat in Saul in David mittang vaidou in anei panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh azing niin hichi ahing hi a, Pasian sawl hagau gilou Saul tungah atungta a, inn sungah thu mavang gen in aham bielbuol a, tualeh David in abawl ngai bangin atumgingte atum a, ahivangin Saul in a khutah teipi khat a tawi zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in “David bang toh ka kilden ding chiin ateipi in akhaw pheita hi,” hinanleh David in niveitah akihepkhiet san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin Saul in David agiingta mama hi, aziehpen Mangpa’n David a umpi a, Saul anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Saul in David khu ama kunga kipat in asuondoh a, galkap tul khatte tunga lamkai in apangsah tahi, tualeh mipite masangah alutin apawt zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh David pen abawl taphot ah kituptah in agamta zel a, tualeh Mangpa’n ama a umpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin, kitup tah a gamta ahi chi Saul in amu in agiing semsem ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelte leh Judate zousie in amasang ua lut a apawt zel ziehin David ait mama ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in David kungah, “Ka tanu upazaw Merab tanah aum hi, amanu na zi dingin ka hing peding hi; kei dingin hangsan tahin um phot mai inlen, Mangpa kidouna dou in,” achi hi. Aziehkhu Saul in “Atungah keiman khut halouin Philistin miten atung ah khut hazaw uheh,” achina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh David in Saul kungah, “Kei koi ka hia, ka hinna zong bang ahia, ka innkuonpite leh ka pa innkuonpi zong Israelte lah ah bang ahi ua, leengpa mahpa kahina dingin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh hichi ahia, Saul tanu Merab David toh kiten sah ding hun ahing tun kuontahin Melohath mi Adriel zi dingin apeta mawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul tanu Mikal in David angai mama a; Tua thu Saul ahil ua, tua thu in Saul akipah sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in, “Amanu David adinga a awhna ding thang ahing hi theina ding leh Philistin miten atunga khut ahah theina dingun, amanu David ka pe ding hi,” achi hi. Tuaziehin Saul in David kungah “Tuni’n ka mahpa nahi kia thou thou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in asuohte thu apie a, “Aguh in David houpi unlen, akungah, En in Lengpa na tung ah akipah a, tualeh asuohte zousie’n ahing ngaina mama uhi, tuaziehin tuin, leengpa mahpa in pang in;” chi un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul suohten David zah mama ah tua thu zousie ava genta uhi. Tualeh David in “Migenthei leh koima ngaisahlou kei banga dingin, leengpa mahpa a panding khu sil namai hi dingin na ngaisut uoi mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Saul suohten akungah, “David in hichibang in agen hi,” chiin ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in “David kungah, tambangin gen un. Lengpa’n agalte tunga phu alah theina dingin Philistinte vuntep zakhat chilou azi man ding bangma adeisih hi, achi hi,” chi un, achi hi. Hinanleh Saul in David pen Philistin mite khuta shisah atum chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuohten tam thute David ahil u’leh, Lengpa mahpa a apan ding David akipah mama hi. Hinanleh ani chiem abei nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin David ading doh a, amite toh ava kuon ua, Philistin mite avathat ua, tualeh atepvun uh ahing puo a, leengpa mahpa ahitheina dingin leengpa kungah kimtah in apie hi, tuachi’n Saul in atanu Mikal azi dingin apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa’n David aumpi hi chi Saul in amu in athei chienta hi; tualeh Saul tanu Mikal in ama a it ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in David agiing sem semta hi. Tualeh Saul khu David melma ahi denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin miliente galdou dingin a kuonkhe zel uhi. Tualeh hichi ahi a, akuon khieh pouma chiengun David khu Saul suohte zousie sanga pilvang zawin agamta zel a, tuachi’n amin tawisangin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in atapa Jonathan leh anasemte zousie kungah, David na tha ding uh ahi chin thu ahilta hi; Hinanleh Jonathan in David angaina mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul tapa Jonathan in David kungah, “Ka pa Saul in tha dingin ahing sui hi, tuaziehin zingmawng chiengin pilvang tahin kikem hoi inlen munsip khat ah kiphuol dap maiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh na kiphuolna gamlah ah keima hing peivang in, ka pa kungah ka va ding dinga, na tungtang thuah ka pa ka houpi dinga, tuachi’n thuzah ka nei pouma leh ka hinghil ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in apa Saul kungah, David agen phata hi, akungah, “Leengpa’n asuohpa David tungah sil bawlkhiel vawt sih heh; aziehpen David in na tungah gitlouna abawl ngai sih hi, asilbawl zousie lah nanga dingin ahoimama ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman ashi ding zong khawhsalou in Philistin mipa athat a, tuachi’n Mangpa’n Israel mi zousie a dingin hundamna thupitah ahing tungsahta hi, tuakhu nangman zong namu a, na kipah mama hi. Tuaziehin azieh bei a David that a, mawna neilou sisan tunga khiel ding na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Jonathan thugente angaikhie a, Saul akichiema, “Mangpa hinna louin ka kichiem hi, David akithat sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in David ahandoh a, tam thu zousie ahilta hi. Tualeh Jonathan in David khu Saul kungah ahing zawpi a, tuachi’n nidanga aum ngaibangin akungah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh kidouna aum kia a, David ava kuon a, Philistinte ava douta a, thachitahin ava that a, amasang ah ataizahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Saul akhut a teipi tawi a innsunga atou laiin, Mangpa akipat a hagau gilou atungah ahing tungta a, David in tumging akhut a atum laitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in David khu a teipi a bangtoh khawdeen atum a, hinanleh David pen Saul akipat in ana kitholmang hiau a, tuachi’n teipu khu bangah akiphut tang vevong hi, tuachi’n David atai khie a khum zan in asuohta tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in buhdap a, zingmawng chienga that dingin David inn ah mi asawl a. Hinanleh David zi Mikal in David kungah, “Tuzan a, na hinna na humbit sihleh, zing chienga hing that ding ahi uh” chi’n ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikal in David kotta ah akhaikhe suh a, tuachi’n ataimanga, asuohta ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mikal in milim khat ala a, lupna ah asiel a, alu lam ah kelmul tangkhap akoi a, tuachi’n puon akhut a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in David pui dinga mi asawl chiengin, amanu’n “Achi na hi,” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in David en dingin mi asawl kia a, “Ka tha theina dingin alupna pum in ka kungah hing zawng un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh ami sawlte avalut u’leh, lupna ah milim alu lam a kelmul tangkham khap in ana um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Mikal kungah, “Bangdinga tambang a, nang sola ka galpa na sawlmanga, na suotatsah ahiei?” achi hi. Tualeh Mikal in Saul adawnga, “Hingpei sahin, bangzieh a nang hing that ding ka hiei mah?” achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n David ataimang a, asuohta ta hi. Tualeh Ramah khuo a Samuel kungah ava tunga, Saul in atunga abawl zousie ahilta hi. Tualeh ama leh Samuel apei ua, Naioth ah ava um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh, “Ngai in, Ramah khuo a Naioth ah David a um hi,” chi’n Saul ahil ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in David pui dingin mi asawl a. Tualeh guolnei pawlte thumavang genna kikou lai leh atung ua Samuel lamkai apang amutah un Saul misawlte tungah Pasian Hagau atungta a, tuachi’n ama un zong thu mavang agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Saul ahil u’leh, aman midangte asawl kia a, ama u’zong tuabanga thumavang gen in aumta uhi. Tualeh Saul in athumveina dingin mite asawl kia a, tua miten zong tuabangma in thu aphuong zelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama zong Ramah khuo ah ava haw a, Seku mun a tuikul lienpi kung ava tunga, tualeh “Samuel leh David hei a um ahi uoi?” chi’n adonga. Tualeh mi khat in, “Ngai in, Ramah khuo a Naioth ah aum uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul zong Ramah khuo a Naioth ah ava pei a, tualeh Mangpa Hagau ama tungah zong ahing tungta a, Ramah khuo a Naioth mun atun dongin apei kawm in thumavang aphuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh aman zong apuonsilte asutkhie a Samuel masangah thu mavang aphuongdoh a, tuami ni sun nitumin leh zan khovah in, puonsillou in guohtangin alumta hi. Tuaziehin “Saul zong guolneite lah a pang sam hi maw?” akichi zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khu Ramah khuo Naioth akipat in ataidoh a, Jonathan kungah ava haw a, akungah, “Bang kana bawla ahiei? tualeh bang tatsietna ka nei a ahiei? Tualeh napa masanga bang ahiei kabawl khiel pentah leh ka khelna? hichia tha dinga ahing sui kawi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in akungah “That laizang lou e, shi vawt sihvateh, Ngaiin, ka pa’n kei hing theisah masalou in bangma zousie lien in neu taleh abawl ngai sih hi, bang zieha tam thute hing im ding ahiei? Ahing im vawt sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n David akichiem kia nalai a akungah, “Na pa’n na mit mua deisahna katan athei chien mama a, Jonathan in tam thu pen theida mai heh khuchilouin lunggim seng khava achi ahi ding, tualeh na hinna lou in ka gen ahi, shina leh kei kikaal ah kal khat bep a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in David kungah, “Na hinna in alunggul pouma ka hing bawl pieh zel ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh David in Jonathan kungah, “Ngai in, zing chieng hatha ni ding ahia, leengpa kunga pellou a annkuong im ding ka hi a, hinanleh ani thum ni nitah lam dongin gamlah a kibu dingin kava kuon zaw mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pa’n ka umlou ahing theidoh chiengin, David in akhuo uh Bethlehem a, ainnkuonpite zousie toh kumchin kithoina nei ding ahi ziehun, vahaw tavang chin ahing ngen va ngut hi, na chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hoive achileh, na suohpa lung muongin ka um dinga, hinanleh alungthah leh vang sil hoilou bawl tum ahi chi theimai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin na suohpa Mangpa thuhun na bawlpi tah ngal leh, hoitahin bawl mai in, ahivangin thulimlouna ka neileh nangman hing that suh mai in, bangdinga napa kunga nang puise ding ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonathan in akungah, “That laizang lou e, ka pa’n na tunga sil hoilou bawl atum chi ka thei pouma leh nangma hing hillou in ka um diei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Jonathan kungah, “Na pa’n hing na huotdawn taleh koi in kei ahing hilta diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in David kungah, “Hing pei vawi gamlah ah va vah tadi vai,” achi a; tuachi’n ani un gamlah ah ava vahta gel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in David kungah, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian ahing theipipa hihen, zing chieng tuhun ahiei ahisihleh anithum niin ahiei, chiengin ka pa kungah thu ka va dawp dinga, ngaiin David tungtang thu ahoi ahileh mi hing sawl in kang theisah sih diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ka pa’n na tunga sietna abawl tup ka hing hillou a, na lung muonna dinga ka hing sawlmang sihleh, Mangpa’n Jonathan aut dandan in bawl henlen tua sanga nasa zaw in zong bawlta hen, tualeh Mangpa’n ka pa ana umpi bangin nang zong hing umpi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ka shilouna dinga ka damsung maimai Mangpa lung sietna hing musah hilouin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khangtungtawn in ka innkuonpite tungah na khotuona tawpsah sin, Mangpa’n leitung maikai a David melmate asuhmang tandongin zong tawpsan sin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in David melmate lah ah, Mangpa’n phuba lata hen, chiin David innkuonpite kungah thuhun abawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in ka hing it hi chiin David in thu achiemsah kia hi, aziehpen Jonathan in ama hinna ait bangin David ait hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in David kungah, “Zing chienga ha tha ding ahi a; na touna a awng ding ahi ziehin, na umlou akilang ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni thum nava umzou chiengin, hing peisuh pai inlen, masanga tam buoina ahing kipat chiillai a, na kibutna mun ah hing pei inlen, Ezel suong pang ah na um denin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n muichiemna khat neibangin, tua suong pang lam ah thal tang thum ka hing kap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin naupang khat ka hing sawl dinga, pei inlen thaltangte va suiin kachi dinga, thaltangte na umna apat tamlang pangah aum hi; tawm inlen hing peiin, kachi leh Mangpa hinna louin ka gen ahi, nanga dingin lungmuonhuoi leh zauna ding umlou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh naupangpa kunga, En in, thaltangte na gallangah a um hi, ka chileh peimang maiin, Mangpa’n ahing peimang sah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh nang leh ken sil igensate tungtang thu ah ngaiin, nang leh kei kikaal ah kumtawn in Mangpa aum ngitnget hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n David gamlah ah akibu denta a, tualeh ha tha ahing hiin, leengpa annkuong im dingin adawkanah atouta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lengpa khu nidanga atou ngaina bangin, bang gei a atouna ah atou a, tualeh Jonathan adinga, Abner Saul gei ah atou a, tuachi’n David touna a awng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul in tua ni in bangma agen sih hi. Aziehpen aman atungah bang ahiei khat aum a asienglou hiva, asienglou ahi ngeingei ding chi’n a ngaisut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh azing ni’n hichi ahia, hatha a ni ni in David mun khu a awng nalai a, tuachi’n Saul in atapa Jonathan kungah, “Bang zieha Jesse tapa tuni leh zani a ann ne dinga hing peilou ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in Saul adawnga, akungah “David in Bethlehem a hawdingin phalna ahing ngen va ngua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aman hepitahin hing hawsah teitei in, aziehpen ka innkuonpiten khosunga kithoina nei ding ahi uhi, tualeh ka u in khuna pang dingin thu ahing pie hi, tualeh tuin na mitmu a deisahna katan leh, hepitahin hing phal maiin kava haw ding hi, tuachi’n ka sanggamte ka va ve ding achi hi. Tuazieh a leengpa dawkan a ann ne dinga hing peilou ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul khu Jonathan tungah alungthah phuta, “Nang numei gilou leh paupeng tapa, nangma zumna ding leh nanu guohtanna zum sah dingin Jesse tapa na tel ahi chi na theisih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen Jesse tapa leitunga adam laisie nangma leh nagam suhdet ahi sih ding hi, Tuaziehin tuin vahan sahin, ashi ngeingei ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jonathan in apa Saul adawnga akungah, “Bangzieh a ama na tha ding ahiei? Aman bang ahiei abawl?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in ama kho tum in ateipi alam a, tuaziehin Jonathan in apa’n David tha atum tahtah na hi chi athei chienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan khu adawkan apat in lungthah sengin adingdoh a, tuami ha nina ni ni’n ann aneta sih hi, apa’n David azalat sah zing ziehin alung gimpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, azingmawng in Jonathan in naupang khat azawpi a, David toh akichiemna mun guot u’leh hun guot dung zui un gamlah ah ava peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh aman naupangpa kungah, “Tai inlen ka thaltang kapte va tawmin,” achi hi. Tualeh khum naupang atai lai in Jonathan in thaltang gallam ah akap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in akap thaltang tuhna a, naupangpa atun tahin, Jonathan in naupangpa anua hat a, akungah, “Na gallam ah thaltang aum hilou amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in naupangpa ahan a, “Kinaw in, hing pei mengin, zekai sin” achi hi. Tuachi’n Jonathan naupangpa’n thaltangte akhawma, apu kungah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh naupangpa’n bangma athei vateh sih a, Jonathan leh David behin thu umdan athei giap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Jonathan in agalvante naupangpa kung ah apie a, akungah “Pei inlen galvante khu khuo ah na peipi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua naupangpa apei zoutahin, David aumna mun simlam pang akipat adingdoh a, amai lei lah a phain thumvei abohkhup hi. Tualeh akikawi ua, akitawp ua, akikaatuo ua, hinanleh David ahakaa dieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonathan in David kungah, “Lungmuong tahin pei tan aw; Mangpa nang toh ikaal ah leh nahah nasuonte leh ka hah ka suonte kaal ah kumtawn in umta hen, achi hi. Mangpa min in ikichiem tuoh zouta hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n adinga apeita hi. Tualeh Jonathan pen khuo ah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Nob khuo a siempu Ahimelek kungah ahing pei a: tualeh Ahimelek in chitun kawm in David ana dawn a, akungah “Bangchidan ahiei na hichi tangtat a, zawpi neilou na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh David in siempu Ahimelek kungah, “Leengpan sil khat bawl dingin thu ahing pie a, tualeh ka kungah ka hing sil bawlsah tup leh ka hing thupieh khu koiman theisih heh, achia; tualeh tangvalte umna ding mun ka guot siengta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin na khut ah bang aum ei? Tanghou beu nga hing pie in, ahisihleh na nei lam lam achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempuin David adawnga, “Tanghou khatpou ka khut ah aum sih a, hinanleh tanghou siengthou vang ka nei hi, tangvalte numei lah a kipat akikep siengthou pou u’leh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in siempupa adawnga, akungah “Adihtahin tu nithum sung numei lah ah ka siengthou chietna uhi; Tualeh ka hing pawtkhiet ding lai un zong tangvalte um le belte zong asiengthouna hi, sawlna khohtah a akuon chiengun akikem siengthou ua, tuaziehin akikem siengthou nah mama uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempuin tanghou siengthou khu apeta a, aziehpen khum mun a tanghou kikoite alah ni ua tanghou lum a hen zel ding Mangpa masanga kipata kila tanghou siengthou chilou tanghou dang mawngmawng aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh khum niin Saul suohte lah a mi khat Mangpa masanga hentang in ana um a, amapa min Doeg, Edom mi ahia, Saul ganchingte lah a lamkaipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh David in Ahimelek kungah, “Tanah, teipi ahiei namsau ahiei, na khut ah na kem khasih amah? Lengpa mai a kintah a nasep akiphatmaw ziehin, Ka namsau leh ka galvan khat beh ka hing keng man sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh siempupa’n “Philistin mi Goliath Elah phaijang a na thapa namsau en in, puon a kituom in siempu puonah lie ah aum hi, tuami nadei leh lain, tuami chilou adang a um sih hi,” achi hi. Tualeh David in “Tuasanga hoi zaw a um diei mah hing pie’n” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n David adingkhie a, khum ni in Saul giing in ataimangta hi, tualeh Gath leengpa Akish kungah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Akish suohten akungah, “Tam mipa agam leengpa uh David hilou amah? Saul in atul atul in athat a, David in atul sawm atul sawm in athat hi chia lam kawm a kikhieng in la asa uh hilou amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh David in tam thute alungtang ah avom a, tuachi’n Gath leengpa Akish agiing mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n amasang uah a umdan ahenglamdang a, amit mu uah akimosah a, kul kotkhate akhuot a, akhamul lah ah akhatetui aluong sah niai nuai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Akish in asuohte kungah, “En un, tam mipa amo ahi, chi na thei sasa ua, bangdinga ka kunga nang zawpi uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi maw kaki tahsap zieh a, tam mipa, amot dan sulang dinga ka umna a na hing zawpi uh amah? Tam mipa ka innsungah ahing lut talawm ding amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin David khum mun akipat in apawtdoh a, Adullam kawlhawm ah aumta hi. Tualeh a sanggamte leh apa innkuonpi zousie’n tua thu azah tahun khummun a akungah ava haw suhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh michin lunggimna nei pouma, leiba nei pouma tualeh lungkimlouna neite zousie akungah ahing peikhawm ua, tuachi’n David khu atung ua lamkai in apangta hi, tuachi’n akungah mi zali vel a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n David tua mun akipat in Moab gam a Mizpah ah apei a, tualeh Moab leengpa kungah, “Pasian in bang ahiei ahing bawlpieh ding chi ka thei masangsie, ka nu leh ka pate hing pei u’henlen na kungah hing um uheh, chi’n ka hing ngen hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab leengpa masangah, amauh ahing zawpia, tualeh kawhawm sunga David a um sung sie’n akungah a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n goulnei Gad in David kungah, “Kawlhawm sungah umden sinlen, pawtdoh inlen, Juda gam lam ah pei in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n David apawta Hareth gammang ah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in David leh akunga umte amudohta uh chi ana zata a tuin Saul Gibeah khuo a Tamarisk sing nuoi ah akhut a teipi tawi in atou a, tualeh asuohte zousie akim ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in akiima ding asuohte kungah, “Tuin nou Benjamin mite aw ngaikhie un, Jesse tapa in nouhaw, loute leh grep huonte ahing pe chiet na diei mah, tualeh galkap atul atulte tungah leh aza azate tungah lamkai in ahing pangsah na diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na unpi un na hing phielgu ua, ka tapa in Jesse tapa toh thuhun abawl uh koima khat in zong na hing theisah sih uhi; kei dinga khawhsa mawngmawng koima na um sih ua, tualeh ka tapa in ka suohpa kei hing douding leh tuni nasan a zong kei hing lamtan dinga achiil nahlai thu ka kunga sulang na um sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul suohte toh ding khawm Edom mi Doeg in adawnga, akungah, “Jesse tapa Nob khuo ah Ahitup tapa Ahimelek kunga hing pei kana mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh aman Mangpa kungah adoh pieh a, neh ding apie a, tualeh Philistin mi Goliath namsau zong ape nalai hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Ahitup tapa Siempu Ahimelek leh apa inn sungmi zousie leh Nob khuo a siempu um zousie ahan sah a; Tualeh amaute abawn un leengpa kungah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in, “Nang Ahitup tapa tuin na ngaikhie in” achi hi. Tualeh aman adawnga “Pu aw tanah ka um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in akungah, “Bangdinga nang leh Jesse tapa kithukup a kei hingdou nahi uoi? Tanghou leh namsau na pie a, bangdinga keima ahing douna dinga Pasian kunga thu nadoh pieh a tuni donga kei ahing lamtan ahiei?” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahimelek in adawnga akungah, “Leengpa mahpa na mi dohpen, na innsunga zatat um pen, na suohte zousie lah a David banga muonhuoi koi aum ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama dinga Pasian thu ka dohpieh apatna ahiei mah? ahi keisih hi. Lengpa’n asuohpa ahiei, ka pa innsungmi zousie ahiei hing ngoh vawt sih heh, na suohpa’n tam thute alien aneu bangma ka theikha mawngmawng sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akungah, “Ahimelek na shi teitei ding ahi, nang leh napa innsung mizousie toh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n akim a ama venga ding galkapte kungah, “Kihei unlen Mangpa siempute that un, David lam a apan zieh u’leh ataina lam theinazen a, ahing hillou ziehun,” achi hi. Hinanleh leengpa suohte koiman Mangpa siempute tung ah khut aha nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Doeg kungah, “Nangma kihei inlen, siempute satlia in,” achi hi. Tualeh Edom mi Doeg akihei a siempute a satlia ta hi. Tua ni in siempu puontuol sil ngen sawm giet leh nga athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh siempute khuo a um numei, pasal, naupang leh nausen nawine lai nasan leh bawngte sabiltungte leh belamte zong namsau hiem in asatliata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Ahitup tapa Ahimelek tapate lah a khat amin Abiathar asuohta a, David kungah atai lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Abiathar in, Saul in Mangpa siempute atha thu David ahila.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh David in Abiathar kungah, “Tuami niin Edom mi Doeg a um chileh Saul ahil ngei ngei ding chi ka thei hi, na pa innkuonte keima zieh a shi ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang ka kungah um inlen zausin, kei tha hing tumten nang zong tha ahing tum ding uhi, ka kungah umlachin na suohta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Ngaiin Philistin miten Keilah khuo asim ua, phuola bute alahpieh uhi chi’n David ahil uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin David in Mangpa adong a; “Ka va pei in Philistinte ka va bulu ta diei?” achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n David kungah, “Philistin mite va bulu inlen Keilah khuo va humbit in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh David miten akungah, “En in, tam Juda gam a um zong kizau nalai a, Keilah khuo a Philistin mite dou dinga va kuon ding zauhuoi dieh ven,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Mangpa adong kia a, Tualeh Mangpa’n adawnga, “Thou inlen Keilah khuo ah kuon suh in, Philistin mite na khut ah ka hing pe ding;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh David leh amite Keilah khuo ah akuon suh ua, Philistin mite ava dou ua, mi tampi athat ua, agantate uh alahpieh uhi. Tuachi’n David in Keilah khuo a mite ahundohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, Ahimelek tapa Abiathar Keilah khuo a David kung a, atai laiin, siempu puonahtuol akhut a tawi pum a pei suh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Keilah khuo ah David apeita chi Saul ahil uhi. Tuachi’n Saul in, “Pasian in ama ka khut a hing pie ahi tave; kul kotpi leh akilna nei khopi alut in akikhah khumta ngal a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in mi zousie, Keilah khuo a peisuh a, David leh amite imtawm ding leh dou dingin ahankhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul in atungah aguh in silhoilou abawl hi chi David in ana thei a; Siempu Abiathar kungah “Siempu puonahtuol hing tawi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in, “Aw Israel Mangpa Pasian na suoh keima ziehin Saul in khuo suse dingin Keilah khuo ah hing kuonsuh atum hi chi kana za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keilah khuo miten akhut ah ahing pekhe ding uoi? Na suoh in azah bangin Saul ahing kuonsuh tahtah diei? Aw Israel Mangpa Pasian, na suohpa hing hil in, ka hing ngen ahi,” achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah, “Hing peisuh ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in, “Keilah khomiten Kei leh ka mite Saul khut ah ahing pekhe ding uoi?” achi hi. Tualeh “Mangpa’n ahing pe ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh amite zaguh dingvel adingdoh ua, Keilah khuo apat in apawtdoh ua, apeitheina lam lam chiet uah apeita uhi. Tualeh Keilah khuo akipat in David ataikheta chi Saul ahil ua, Tuachi’n agal kuon ding akhawlsah tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh David khu gamdai a, leikohawmte ah a um a, tualeh Ziph gamdai a singtang gam ah aumdenta hi. Tuachi’n Saul in ni simin David asui a, hinanleh Pasian in akhut sungah David apesih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Ziph gamdai a Horesh mun a aum laiin Saul in ama tha tumin asui kawi hi chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Saul tapa Jonathan adingdoh a, Horesh mun a um David kungah ava haw a, Pasian in na khut ahing hatsah zel ding hi chi’n David ava hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh akungah, “Zau vawtsin, ka pa Saul khut in ahing suidohbut sih ding hi. Israelte tungah leeng na hing hidinga, nang ban ah kei kahi ding hi; tam thu ka pa Saul in athei kilkel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute gelin Mangpa masangah thuhun abawl ua, tualeh David khu Horesh mun ah aumdenta a, Jonathan pen innlang ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ziph mite Gibeah khuo a Saul kungah ava peitou ua, “David ka kung ua Jeshmon simlang a um Hakilah singtaang gam a Horesh leikohawm lah a, kiphuol hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Aw leengpa na hinna in atup bangin hing peisuh inlen, tualeh koute bawl ding ahileh leengpa khuta ama hing na piehkhiet ding ahi” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in, “Noute Mangpa’n hing guolzawlta hen, nouten kei nang hepi mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hepitahin pei unlen akibutna mun va thei chien zawsem unlen, anua vazui unlen, tualeh khum mun a koi vamu ahiei hing kanchien un. Ama khu pilkhel tah a gamta ahi chi mi’n ahing hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin akibutna mun zousie hing thei unlen, tualeh thu chientah toh ka kungah hing peikia tei tei unlen, tuachi’n nou toh ipei suh ding hi. Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, gamsunga um ahi nahpouleh Juda namte zousie lah akipat in ka suidoh nading hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n akipandoh ua, Saul masangah Ziph gam ah apeita uhi. Hinanleh David leh amite khu Maon gamdai a, Jeshmon simlam phaijangah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul leh amite David suidinga akuon tahun, David kungah ava hil ua. Tuaziehin Maon gamdai a, suongpi umna lam zuon in apei suhta hi. Tua thu Saul in azahtah in Maon gamdai ah David anuadel ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n taang pang lang khat ah apei a, tualeh David leh amite taang lelam pang langkhat ah apei uhi. Tualeh David khu Saul zau in kintah a kihepmang atum hi; aziehpen Saul leh amiten David leh amite mattum in a imkuol ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanlezong Saul kungah “Thangkou mi ahing tunga, kintahin hing pei in, Philistin miten igam ahing dou uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin Saul in David anuadel lai akinualesan a, Philistin mite dou dingin akuonta hi; tuazieh in tuamun khu (suotat na suongpi) achita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khum mun akipat in apeitou a En Gedi suong kohawmte ah aumta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, Saul Philistin mite vadel ahing ki nuale kia laiin, “Ngai in, David khu En-Gedi gamdai ah a um hi,” chi’n ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Israel mite zousie lah akipat mi tul thum atel tuomte azawpi a, David leh amite sui dingin gam sakelte umna suongpite lang ah akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n lamkaal a belam huong kohawm umna ava tung ua, tualeh Saul khu khawl tawldam dingin ava lut hi. Tualeh David leh amite khu kohawm sunggil lam ah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh David miten akungah, “Ngai in, Mangpa’n na kungah, na khut ah na melma ka hing pe dinga, a tungah hoi nasah dandan in bawlin achi khu tuni ahi,” achi uhi. Tualeh David adingdoh a, Saul puontuol mong aguhin ava attan piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaminuoin hichi ahia, Saul puontuol mong ava attan pieh ziehin David lungsim ana mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh aman amite kungah, “Mangpa sathau nu ahi chi thei sasa a, atunga ka khut ha a, Mangpa sathau nusa ka pu tunga khut ka hah khu Mangpa’n aphal sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in tua thu toh amite azawl lungdam a, Saul dou dinga akuon ding uh aphal sih hi. Tualeh Saul athou a, kolhawm akipat apawtdoha, apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anua deu in David zong adingdoh a, kawlhawm a kipat in apawtdoh a, “Ka pu leengpa aw,” chi’n Saul anuahat a, tualeh Saul hing kinuahei a, a et leh David in tuol a bohkhup in zana apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh David in Saul kungah, “David in na sietna ding abawl hi chia miten na kunga agen uh bangdinga tahsang na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngaiin tuni’n kawlhawm sunga na umlai in Mangpa’n nang pen ka khut sunga ahing piehkhiet dan na mit ngeiin namu hi. Nang that dinga hing sawl pawl aum ua, hinanleh keiman ka hing hinkhawi nalai hi, ka pu tungah khut ha vawt sih vang ama lah Mangpa sathau nusa ahingal a, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, pa, en in, na puon mong zong ka khut ah ka tawi nalai hi; na puon mong attan thei ngal inga, ka hing thalou khu ka khutah silhoilou leh bawlsietna leh helna lungsim a um sih chi leh, na tungah khelna ka nei sih chi leh ka hinna lah tumin hing sui kawi nanlachin zong na tungah ka khiel sih hi chithei teitei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n nang toh ikaal thu ngaituota hen, Mangpa’n na tungah phu hing lahpieh tahen; hinanleh ken vang na tungah khut ka havawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nidanglai paunah in, Migilou akipat in gitlouna apawt zel achi a; hinanleh ken vang na tungah khut ka hasih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel leengpa koi sui a hingkuon na hiei? koi ahiei na nuadel? Ui shisa leh uihit nuadel na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa, khu thukhentu hi henlen, tualeh nang leh kei kikaal ah thu akhen dinga, ka tung thu ah en chien in hing genpieh henlen, na khut akipat in hing hundohta hen” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing ahia, David in tamthute Saul kunga agen zou in, Saul in “Tam khu nang awsuo ama ka tapa David?” achita hi. Tualeh Saul aw ngaitah in akapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman David kungah “Kei sangin nang na dihtat zaw hi, nangma’n keitung ah sil hoi na bawl ziehin, ken na tungah sil hoilou in ka hing thuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa’n na khut sunga kei ahing pieh lai a zong na hing tha tuomlou zieh in, tuni’n ka tung a silhoi na bawldan na sulangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi’n a melma mu taleh damtahin apeisah mawh ding ama? Tuaziehin tunia ka tunga na silhoi bawlte ziehin Mangpa’n silhoi in nang hing thuhta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh tuin, ngaiin leengpa na hing hi dinga, Israel leenggam na khutah suhkip ahi ngei ding achi hi, tunvang ka thei chienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka nua a, ka hahlesuonte that gamlou ding leh ka pa innsunga kipat ka min sumanglou dingin, Mangpa min in kichiem in achita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n David zong Saul kungah akichiemta hi. Tuachi’n Saul a innlangah apeita hi; Hinanleh David leh amite pen kawlhawm lam zuon in apeitouta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel ashita a; tualeh Israel mite zousie ahing kikhawm ua, asuunta uhi. Tualeh Ramah khuo a ainn ah avuita uhi. Tuazou in David adingdoh a Paran gamdai ah apei suhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maon khuo ah mi khat a um a, anasepna mun khu Karmel muol ahi. Amapa khu mihausa tah ahia, belam tul thum leh kel tul khat anei hi, Karmel muol ah belam mul amet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua mipa min Nabal ahia, azi min Abigail ahi. Tualeh amanu sil theisiemna nei numei leh melhoi tah ahi; Hinanleh apasal khu mi genha leh gamtat hoilou mi ahia, Kaleb hahlesuon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh David in gamdai akipat in Nabal in belam mul amet hi chi ana za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in tangval sawm asawl a; tualeh David in tangvalte kungah, “Karmel muol ah va peitou unlen, Nabal kungah vahaw unlen, ka min in chibai va buh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mi neizoupa kungah hichibangin hing gen un, Na tungah, na innkuonpite tungah leh na nei zousie tungah hamuonna umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Belam mulmet mite nanei chi kana za a, na belam chingte ka kungah ahing um zel ua, bangma kalaw ngai sih ua, Karmel muol a aum sungsie uh bangma amansuo ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tangvalte donglachin ahing hil mai ding uhi. Tuaziehin ka tangvalten na mitmu ah deisahna tangta uhen. Pawi bawl huntah a hing pei ka hi ziehun, na suohte leh na tapa David nanei dandan na pie in, achi hi, chi’n vagen un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n David tangvalten ava tun tah un, David min in tua thu zousie Nabal kungah agen ua, angahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Nabal in David suohte adawnga, “David koi ahiei, tualeh Jesse tapa zong koi ahiei? Tulai in suoh tampi apute uh taimangsan atam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tanghou, ka tui leh ka belam mulmette dinga ka gawsa maw la a, ahing kipatna uh ka theilou mite, ka pieh kawi mama ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n David tangvalte akihei ua, anua peikiata uhi; tualeh atun un, tua thu zousie David ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in amite kungah, “Na namsau uh kuo chietun” achi hi. Tuachi’n anamsau uh a kuo chiet ua, tualeh David in zong anamsau akuo a, tualeh mi zali in David azui ua, tualeh mi zani neitahte vengin aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh asuohte lah a khat in, Nabal zi Abigail ana hil a, “En in, David in gamdai akipat in kapu uh chibai buh dingin mi ahing sawl a, aman ana housie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh tua mite kou a dingin ahoi mama ua, ka sietna dinguh bangma abawl sih uhi, gam lahah ka um ua, ama u’toh ka um khawm sungun bangma ka mansuo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Belam chinga ama u’toh ka um sungsie un, sun leh zan in kou a dingin kulpi ahi mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, ngaituo in bang ahiei na bawl ding, aziehpen kapu uh tung leh a innkuonpite zousie tungah sietna bawl tum a um hi; Amalah mithusie koima houpi theilou ahi ngal a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abigail in kintahin tanghou pheng zani, uoin thawl ni toh, huon dinga bawlzousa belam nga toh, bu ki kangsa atena dim nga toh, grepga kiphou gaw um dim zakhat toh, theipi ga apat kibawl tanghou pheng zani ala khawm a, sabiltungte tungah akhangtou tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n asuohte kungah, “Ka masangah pei unlen, ngai un na nua uah ka hing pei ding hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh amanu’n Nabal ahil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing ahia, Amanu sabiltung tunga tuonga muol pang ken a ahing pei suh laiin; David leh amite amanu lam zuon in ahing pei suh ua, tuachi’n amanu’n ana lamtuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David in “Bangma amansuo louna dingin, gamdai ah tua mipa nei zousie athawn a na ven pieh suoh ka hita ve; Aman lah silhoi silhoilou in ahing thuh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zingmawng khovah chienga, anei zousie pasal khat zong ka hinkhawi leh Pasian in David melmate alaw law lawta hen, tuasanga thupi zawin zong bawlta heh,” ana chi zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Abigail in David amu tahin sabiltung tunga pat in akum suh pai a, amai a tuol suin khupboh in chibai abuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh akengbul ah aboh a, “Kei tungah Pu aw keima tung mama ah, tam thulimlouna um henlen, tualeh na suohnu’n na zahin thu gensah inlen, na suohnu thugen hing ngaikhiet pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pu aw hepitahin tam miphatuom loupa Nabal bangman ngaisin amin leh ama kibang lien ahi, amin Nabal ahia, mimaw ahi. Hinanleh kei na suohnu’n ka pu hing sawl tangvalte kana mukha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin pu aw, Mangpa hinna leh nangma hinna lou in ka gen ahi, Mangpa’n sisan suolou ding leh nangma khut ngei a phuba la dingin ahing phal sih chi thei in, Tuachi’n na melmate leh ka pu sietna ding bawl mite Nabal bangin um mai uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh tu’n na suoh nu’n ka pu dinga ka hing tawi tam silpiehte ka pu hing zui tangvalte pieh hihen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hepitahin na suohnu gamtatkhelnate hing ngaidam in. Mangpa’n kapu innkuon kiptahin ahing bawl ngei ding hi, kapu in Mangpa kidouna adou ziehin, na damsung tengin sil hoilou nangma ah mu ding aum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang hing nuadel ding leh na hinna sumang dingin mite hing kipan nan u’leh, kapu hinna khu Mangpa na Pasian hinna lom lah a kaan khawm ahi dinga; tualeh na melmate hinna khu, saili kuonga sailungtang kapmang bangin akapmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, Mangpa’n nangma tungtang thu a, anagensa silhoi zousie, ka pu tunga abawl hun chienga, tualeh Israelte tunga vaihawma ahing pansah chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a sisan na suolou zieh leh phuba na lahlou zieh in, nangma dingin lunggimna leh lungnop mawna mawngmawng ahisih ding hi. Hinanleh Mangpa’n kapu tunga silhoi ahing bawl hun chiengin na suohnu hing thei zingin aw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh David in Abigail kungah, “Tunia keima hingdawn dinga hing sawlpa Israelte Mangpa Pasian phat in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh na lemguot siemna guolzawl in um henlen, tualeh sisan suona apat leh ka khut ngei a phuba lahna dinga pat a, hing na hunkhie nangma zong, guolzawl in umta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei hing dawn dinga hing pawtkhe pailou hi lachin, Nangma ka hing liemsah na dinga pat a hing hemkhepa Israelte Mangpa Pasian hinna louin ka gen hi, zingmawng khovah chiengin, Nabal a dingin pasal naupang khat zong ka hinkhawi pieh sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in amanu hing sil tawite ala a, akungah, “Lungmuong tahin na inn lamah peitouta in, Ngaiin na thu ka zui hi, tualeh na ngette zong ka hing pom pieh hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Abigail Nabal kungah ahing tunga, tualeh ngaiin, Nabal in leengte annkuong luina bang mai in a inn ah guolvahna pawi ana bawl hi. Tualeh zu akham mama ziehin Nabal lungsim anuom mama hi, tuaziehin zingmawng khovah masang sie’n amanu’n atawm atam bangma ahil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh azingmawngin hichi ahing ahia, Nabal zu kham ahing thentah in, azi in tam thute ahilta hi, tuachi’n alungsim a bangma ngaituo thei louin, suongtum bang mai in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh ni sawm nua ding vel in, Mangpa’n Nabal tungah akhut aha a, ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh David in Nabal ashi chi azah tahin, ka minsietna dinga, “Nabal sil bawlte akipat ahing genpi a, asuohpa silhoilou bawllou dinga hing kempa, Mangpa phat in um hen. Nabal gitlounate Mangpa’n ama tung mama ah atusah ta hi achia,” tualeh David in Abigail azi dinga va dawp dingin mi asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh David suohte Karmel muola Abigail kunga ava tun tahun, “David in azi dinga nangma hing dawp dingin ahing sawl hi,” chiin amanu ahoupi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Abigail adingdoh a, tuol a khupbohin chibai abuh a, akung uah “Ngaivawi un, na suohnu uh kapu suohte keng sil dinga suoh kahi bou hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abigail adingdoh vat a, Sabiltung tung ah atuonga, anuazui nungah ngate toh, David misawlte azui ua, azi in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />David in Jezreel khuo a mi Ahinoam zong ana puita a, tuachi’n ani un azi in a um tuoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul in atanu David zi Mikal khu Gallim khuo a Laish tapa Paltiel toh ana kiteng sahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu’n Ziphmite Gibeah khuo a Saul kungah “Ahing pei ua, Jeshmon lelam panga Hakilah muol ah David akiphuol hilou amah?” chiin ahing hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul a dingdoh a, Ziph gamdai ah David sui dingin Israel mi teltuom tul thum zawpi in Ziph gamdai ah akuon suhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Jeshmon lelampanga um lampi a Hakilah muol ah panmun akhaw a, hinanleh David khu gamdai ah aum den a, tualeh Saul ama sui in gamdai ah ahing pei hi chi ana thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin David in enkhemite asawl a, Saul ahing pei nahi chi atheichienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh David a dingdoh a, Saul panmun khawna ah ava haw a, tualeh David in Saul leh agalkap lamkai Ner tapa Abner lupna ava mu a, Saul khu giehphuol sungah a lum a, agalkapten ama kimkot in giehmun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Hitmi Ahimelek leh Joab sanggampa Zeruiah tapa Abishai kungah, “Saul giehphuol a keima toh va kuon suh ding koi nahi uoi le?” achia. Tualeh Abishai in “Keima toh iva kuon suh ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Abishai toh zanlai in galkapte umna ah ava peita ua, tualeh giehphuol sungah Saul alum a, aluhung ah ateipi lei ah aphut a, tualeh Abner leh galkapte akimkot in alum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abishai in David kungah, “Tuin Pasian in na melma na khut sungah ahing pie hi, tuaziehin teipi in tuol toh ka sunbet suh aw, nivei sut ngainawn sih va” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh David in Abishai kungah, “That sin, aziehpen Mangpa sathau nu tunga khut ha a, mawtanglou koi a um thei diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David mama in “Mangpa hinna lou in kagen hi. Mangpa’n ama tungah khut ha naven, ahisihleh zong ashini hing tung nava, ahisileh kidouna ah kuon van in, mangthai nava.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa sathau nu tunga ka khut ka hah ding Mangpa’n aphal sih hi. Hinanleh aluhunga teipi leh tuithawl hing la inlen tuachi’n ipei sanding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Saul lu hung a um teipi leh tuithawl ala a, apeikiata uhi, tuachi’n koima’n amu sih ua, koima’n athei sih ua, tualeh koima zong akhanglou sih uhi, Mangpa’n nuomtah a, a imut sah ziehin, a imu chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khu agal lang khat ah apei a, gamlapi a muolvum ah adinga, akikaal uh gamlapi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh David in galkapte leh Ner tapa Abner ahan a, akungah, “Abner aw, hing dawnglou ding na hiei mah?” achia, tuachi’n Abner in ahing dawnga, “Leengpa han khu koi na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Abner kungah, “Mi hangsan khat na hi sih amah? Israelte lah ah nang bang koi aum ei mah? Bang dinga napu leengpa venglou na hiei? Aziehpen napu leengpa sumangthai dingin mi koi ahiei ahing pei hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na silbawl ahoi sih hi. Mangpa hinna lou in ka gen ahi. Na pu Mangpa sathau nu khu navenlou ziehin shitah nahi, tualeh tu’n en in leengpa luhung a teipi leh tuithawl heisunga um atai?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in David aw ahi chi atheikheta a, akungah “Tua khu nangma aw hina maw, ka tapa David?” achi hi. Tualeh David in kapu leengpa “Aw tami keima aw ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh David in akungah, “Bang zieh a kapu leengpa’n asuohpa hichibanga anuadel kawi ahiei? Bang khelna ka nei ahiei? ahisihleh ka khut ah sil hoilou bang aum a ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin kapu leengpa’n na suoh thugen na ngaikhie in; Keima dou dinga a nang hing hanthawn Mangpa ahileh, sillat pom henlen, hinanleh mihing ahi u’leh hamsietin um uheh, aziehpen amaun tuni’n Mangpa gou ka luo theilouna dingin, pei inlen pasien dangte nna vasem in chi’n ahing notdohta uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin tu’n ka sisan Mangpa mu phahlou in gamdangte leitang tungah luong sih heh, muoldawn a vala man dinga mite gam avah bangun, Israel leengpa ui hit nengpou sui dinga hing kuondoh zel hie izaw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in, “Ka khielta hi, hing peikia in ka tapa David. Tuni a na mitmu a ka hinna amanphat mama ziehin na tungah sietna mawngmawng ka bawl nawn sih ding hi. Ngaiin mot huoitah in sil kana bawla, kana sukhiel naah mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh David in adawnga, “En in leengpa teipi ka kungah aum hi, tangvalte khat hing pei henlen hing la heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa’n michin adihtatna leh amuonhuoina bangin kipahman a peding hi, tuni’n Mangpa’n nangma ka khut ah ahing pe na a, hinanleh Mangpa sathau nu tungah ka khut kaha nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin tunia na hinna ka mit mua amanphat bangin, Mangpa mitmu in keima hinna zong manpha tahen, tualeh genthei bawlna zousie apat in hing hundoh tahen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in David kungah, “Ka tapa David guolzawl in um in, sil thupi tah tah na bawl dinga tualeh na zou zel ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n David apeita a, tualeh Saul zong a inn langah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh David in alungsim in, “Bangchih ni ahiei chiengin Saul khut a mangthai khong khong ding ka hia, Philistin mite gam a Kintah a tailut a suotat sanga kei dinga hoizaw um nawnlou ding hi. Saul in Israel gamsung teng ahing sui chiengin alungdongta dinga, tuachi’n akhut a kipat in ka suohta ta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n David a kipandoh a, ama leh akunga um mi zaguh toh, Gath leengpa Maok tapa Akish kungah ava peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khu amipite toh, michin ainnkuonpite chiet utoh, tualeh David zong azi tegel Jezreel mi Ahinoam leh Karmel mi Nabal zi Abigail toh Gath khuo a Akish kungah ava tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Gath khuo ah atai chi Saul ahil ua, tuachi’n asui nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Akish kungah, “Na mitmu a deisahna katan leh na gam sunga khopite lah khat ah tenna ding mun hing pie in, khunah ka teng ding hi, bang zieh a na suohpa nangma toh leengpa khopi sunga teng ding ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua niin Akish in Ziglag khuo apeta hi, tuaziehin tuni dongin Ziglag khuo khu Juda leengte a ahi denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philistinte gam a David a ten hun sung khu kum khat leh ha li ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh David leh amite akuontou ua, Geshur mite, Girzimite leh Amalek mite ava sim uhi. Aziehpen tua namte khu nidanglai akipat a, Shur gam a kipata Izipt gam donga na tengte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh David in ava simna gam taphot numei leh pasal koima ahinkhawi sih hi, hinanleh belamte, bawngtalte, Sabiltungte leh sangawngsaute leh puonsilte alah pieh a, ahing kinuale zel a, Akish kungah ahaw zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Akish in, “Tuni’n heilang nava sim ei?” ana chizel a, tualeh David in “Juda gam simlam-Jerameel mite gam simlam” tualeh “Ken mite gam simlam te, kava simzel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh David in Philistin mite gam sunga aten sung tengin, “David in hichibangin abawl zel hi, chi’n hing gen khava uh achi zieh in,” Gath khuoa thu polut thei ding numei hiin pasal hitaleh hinkhawi mawng mawng anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Akish in David thugen atahsangta a, “Ami Israelte akimuda sah mama a, tuaziehin kumtawn in ka suohin a umden ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hunlai in hichi ahing ahia, Philistin miten Israelte dou dingin agalkapte uh akaikhawm ua. Tualeh Akish in David kungah, “Nang leh na mite kidouna a ka kungah na hing kuon ngei ngei dinguh ahi chi thei in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh David in Akish kungah, “Hi e, na suohpa sil bawlthei dan theina ve chin” achi hi. Tualeh Akish in David kungah, “Tuaziehin kei hing veng lamkai dingin ka hing bawl kumtawnta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu’n Samuel ashita a, tualeh Israelte zousie’n ama asuun chiet ua, tualeh akhuo Ramah ah avuita uhi. Tualeh Saul in aisan siemte leh dawithu siemte agam apat in adeldoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin mite ahing kikaikhawm ua, Shunem ah panmun akhaw uhi. Tualeh Saul in zong Israel mi zousie akaikhawma, Gilboa ah panmun abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul in Philistin galkapte amutahin azauta mama a, alungsim ha tangpi in atuun gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in Mangpa adoh chiengin, manglam ahiei, Urim ahiei, guolneite kam ahiei in zong adawng mawngmawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in asuohte kungah, “Numei dawi ai san siem kunga ka haw a, ka doh thei ding hing sui piehun,” achi hi. Tualeh asuohten akungah “Ngai in, Endor khuo ah dawizawl aisan siem numei khat a um hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul khu akisiem lamdanga, puon dangte asil a, tualeh ama leh midang ni toh apei ua, tualeh zanlai in numeinu kung ava tungta uhi. Tualeh akungah “Dawi ai hing san pieh inlen amin kalaw penpen hing hat pieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei nu’n, akungah, “Ngai in, Saul in agamsunga pat in dawi ai san siemte, dawisiemte asumang sienga, asilbawl dan nathei hi, bang achia ka shina dinga ka hinna thang kamkhum dia kisa na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in amanu kungah, “Mangpa min in akichiem a, tam silziehin gawtna bangma na tungah atungsih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh numei nu’n “Koipen ka hing hatdoh pieh diei?” achi a. Tualeh aman “Samuel hing hatpieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numei nu’n Samuel amu tahin, aw ngai tahin akikoukheta hi. Tualeh numei in Saul kungah, “Bangdinga hing solna hiei Saul lah na hi ngal a” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh leengpan “Zau sin bang ahiei na mu?” achi a. Tualeh “Numeinu’n leilah akipata pasien hing pawtdoh ka mu hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman numeinu kungah, “Bang mel apuo ei?” achia, tualeh amanu’n “Tehse pu khat a hing pawttou a, puontuol asil hi,” achi a. Tualeh Saulin Samuel ahi chi athei a, amai tuolsu in chibai abuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in Saul kungah, “Bangzieha hichibanga buoihuoi taha hing handoh na hiei?” achi a, Saul in “Ka lunggim senga ahi, chi’n adawng hi. Philistin miten ahing dou ua, Pasian in lah ahing kiheimangsanta a, manglam leh guolneite in zong ahing dawng nawn mawngmawng sih hi, Tuazieh in bang bawl ding ka hiei? chi hinghil dinga ka hing hatdoh ahi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Samuel in akungah, “Mangpa’n ahing leengatsanta a, na melma ahita chi theina zenpi a, bangdinga kei na hingdoh nahlai ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa’n keima zanga agen bangbangin abawl ahita hi. Mangpa’n na khuta kipat in na leenggam ahing lah pieh a, na innvengpa David apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa thu na manlou a, athangpaina mama Amalek mite tunga na tangtunlou zieh in, Mangpa’n tam silte tuni’n na tungah abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa’n Israelte nangma toh Philistin mite khutah ahing pekhe dinga, tualeh zing chiengin nang leh na tapate ka kungah na hing umta ding uhi. Mangpa’n Israel galkapte Philistin mite khut ah ahing pekhe ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samuel thugente ziehin Saul azau sengsenga lei ah apua lieng luong a; tha le zung mawngmawng anei sih hi, sun nitum leh zankhovah a ann nelou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh numei khu Saul kungah ahing pei a, abuoi mama chi amu a, “Ngai in, na suohnu’n na gen ka manga, shi zong khawh salou in, ka kunga na thugen ka hing ngaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin tu’n nang zong na suohnu thugen hing ngaikhieh pieh sam inlen, tuachi’n ann themkhat ka hing lui dinga, ne in, na lampeina a tha nanei na dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh a ut sih a, “Kane sih ding” achi hi, hinanleh asuohte leh numei nu’n asawl teitei ua, tuachi’n athu uh amangta hi. Tuachi’n lei akipat in athou a, lupna tungah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu’n ainn ah bawngnou vahthau khat anei a, kintah a kisa in ava thata, tualeh tangbuong ala a, ameh a, tangbuong tolsawlou akang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Saul leh asuohte masang ah ava lui a, tuachi’n ane uhi, tuachi’n adingdoh ua, khum zan in apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin miten agalkap zousiete uh Aphek mun ah ahankhawm ua, tualeh Israelten zong Jezreel tuikhuh kungah panmun akhaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mite lamkai liente aza tel leh atul tel in galkapte endih dingin avah viel viel ua, hinanleh David leh amiten Akish toh galnua aveng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin galkap lamkaiten “Tam Hebru mite tam mun a bang hing bawl ahi uoi?” achi uhi. Tualeh Akish in Philistin galkap lamkaite kungah, “Tam mipa Israelte leengpa Saul suohpa David kum hitan veipi ka um khawmpi a, ahing um akipat tuni donga atatkhelna ka mu nailoupa hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Philistin miliente atungah alungthah ta ua, tualeh Philistin galkap lienten akungah, “Amapa atenna dinga na piehna mun ah nua sawl kia in, kidouna ah eima toh hing kuonda mai heh. Tuachilouin kidouna ah igalte langah pang khava. Tana pasal teng lutang alah masah sih leh apupa toh bang achi kilem thei kia diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam David khu hilou ahiei mah, Saul in atul atul in athat a, David in atul sawm atul sawm in athat hi, chia. Lam kawma la asah khumpa ukhu? achita uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Akish in David ahana, akungah, “Mangpa hinna lou in ka gen ahi, mi dihtah na hi a, galkapte lah a na kuon khieh leh na hing tun dante, ka mitmu in ahoi hi. Ka kunga na hing tun nia kipat tuni dongin na tung ah bangma sietna mawngmawng ka mu keei sih hi, hinanleh zong galkap lamkai ten ahing ngaisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Philistin galkapte lungkimlou a na koi sang in, hamuong tahin nua pei kia maiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Akish kungah, “Ahileh bang kana bawl khiel a ahiei? kapu galte dou dinga ka kuon theilou ding? Tuni donga na kunga ka um sungtengin na suohpa tungah bang na mu ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Akish in adawnga David kungah, “Ka mitmu ah Pasian vansawlsieng bang maiin na hoi hi chi ka thei hi, hinanleh Philistin galkap lienten kidouna ah, ikungah hing kuon mawngmawng sih heh achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin, na kunga um napu suohte toh zingmawng matah in thou unlen, zingmawng phalvah chiengin, matah in peita un,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh amite Philistin gam a ki nuale kia dingin, zingmawng matah a pei dingin, phalvahin athouta uhi. Tualeh Philistin mite zong Jezreel lam zuon dingin akuontou ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, ani thum nia David leh amite Ziglag ahingtun tahun, Amalek miten Simlam leh Ziglag khuo ana sim ua, tualeh Ziglag ana bulu ua, mei in ana haltumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh khosunga mi um zousie alien aneu leh numeite, suoh leh sal in aman ua, koima khat zong that lou in, anazawpi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh amite khuo ahing tung ua, tualeh ngaiin ana katum siengta hi, tualeh azite uh, atapate, atanute uh, sal in ana puimang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh David leh akunga um miteng kap in aw ngaitah in akikou ua, atha zawt dongun akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh David zite gel Jezreel mi Ahinoam leh Karmel mi Nabal zi meithainu Abigail zong sal in ana pui ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh David khu chimawin amangbang mama a, michin atapate u’leh atanute uh ngaituo a daa mama ahi ziehun, David suonga se ding thu agen ta uhi, hinanleh David pen Mangpa a Pasian ah akisuhat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Ahimelek tapa siempu Abiathar kungah, “Hepitahin siempu puonah ka kung ah hing tawi vawi in,” achi hi. Tualeh siempu Abiathar in siempu puonah khu David kungah ahing tawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh David in Mangpa kungah, “Tam galkap honte ka nuadel diei? ka pha zou na diei?” chiin adonga. Tualeh “Aman a dawnga, Del in, na pha ngei ngei dinga, tualeh na hunkhe sieng ngeingei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh akunga um mi zaguhte akuon ua, Besor luita ava tung ua, tua nah ami nuasiete uh aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh David leh mi za li ten anuadel zel ua, mi zanite pen agim sengtah zieh un Besor luita galkai zoulou in khunah aum denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamlah ah Izipt mi khat amu ua, David kungah ahing zawpi ua, tualeh tanghou apie ua, tuachi’n aneta a, tualeh tui zong a dawn sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh theipi apata kibawl tanghou them khat leh akiphougaw lom ni apie ua, tualeh anehzou tahin atha ahing hatkia ta a, aziehpen nithum leh zan thum nelou dawnlou a na um ana hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akungah, “Koi na hiei? hei a hing kipan na hiei?” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Kei Izipt tangval ka hi, Amalek mi khat suohpa ka hia, tualeh ni thum peita sung teng ka chinat zieh in ka pu’n ahing nuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kereth simlam gam leh Juda gam simlam leh Kaleb simlam gam zong ka sim ua, tualeh Ziglag khuo zong mei in kahal tumta, uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh David in akungah, “Tam mihonte kungah nang zawpi suh thei diei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n aman “Hing thatlou ding leh kapu khuta hing pekia lou dingin Pasian min in ka kungah kichiem inlen, tuachi’n tua mihonte kungah ka hing zawpi ding hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman azawpi suh tahin, ngai in, Philistin gam leh Juda gam a gallah sum tampi alah zieh un ne leh dawn leh lam in munchin ah ana umthang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh David in nitah khomiel kuon a kipat azing ni nitah lam dongin Amalek mite adou a, tangval sagawngsau tunga tuonga taimang mi zali suohtate chilou koima khat zong dam a suohta mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amalek miten ana puohmang sieng zousie uh David in anua lah kia siengta hi. Tualeh azite gel zong ahundoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n aneu alien in, atapate uh hiin, atanute uh hitaleh, gallah sil mawngmawng bangma khat zong mansuo neilou in, David in anualah sieng kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh David in belamhon leh ganhon zousie ala a, tuate khu ganta dangte masang ah akai ua, “Tamte khu David gallah silte ahi, “achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh David khu, agim seng zieh ua David zui zou nawnlou mi zani Besor luita a na umdente kung ah ahing tunga. Tuachi’n amaute David leh akunga umte na dawn dingin apawtdoh ua, tualeh David mipite kung ahing tuntahin, amauh chibai abuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n David nuazui a va kuonte lah a migilou leh buoinabawl mite zousie in, “Amaute ikung ua ahing kuonlou zieh un, pasal pouma’n azite u’leh atate uh akipui ua, apeipi uh iphal pieh uh chilou ngal, igallah vante leh iva nualah kia neitahte mawngmawng amaute ipe sih ding,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh David in, “Ka unaute aw, Mangpa’n ahing vengbit a, eima hing dou dinga hingkuonte ikhut a hing pe pa’n ahing pieh silte tuabang a na bawl ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuchia tambang thu nagen uh koi ahiei ngaikhie a zui ding? kidouna a kuonte tan bangbang van leh neitah venga na umten zong atan ding uh ahi, akibanga tanchiet ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum nia kipat in tuni tandongin, Israelte lah ah thupieh leh dan dingin abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David Ziklag atun kiatahin, galvanlah khenkhatte khu, “Mangpa melmate lah a kipata kila gallah vante kipahman a nana tan dingin,” chiin Juda upate leh alawi aguolte kungah ahahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bethel a umte kungah, Ramoth simlam a umte kungah, Jattir a umte kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Aroer a umte kungah, Siphmoth a umte kungah, tualeh Eshtemoa a umte kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rachel a umte kungah, Jerahmeel mite khopi a umte kungah, Ken mite khopi a umte kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hormah khuo a umte kungah, Korashan a umte kungah, Athak khuo a umte kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron khuo a umte kungah, leh David leh amiten azin kawi kawi na ua atotkhah na mun leh gam a umte kungah ahah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin miten Israelte adou ua, tualeh Israelte khu Philistin mite masangah atai zahta ua, Gilboa muol ah tha in a um zelzul ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin miten Saul leh atapate hadel in anuadel ua, tualeh Philistin miten Saul leh atapate Jonathan, Abinadab leh Malkishuah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul tawh kidou a kisattuona anase mama a, tualeh thalkapten akap khata ua, tuachi’n thal in aliem nase mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in agalvan tawipa kungah, “Na namsau dohkhie inlen hing sunlia in, tuachilouin tam teptanloute ahing pei ding ua, ahing dawtlum ding ua ka tungah akithang al kha ding uhi,” achi hi. Hinanleh agalvan tawipan abawl nuomta sih a, azau mama ta hi. Tuabep in Saul in anamsau ala a, abaw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh agalvan tawipan zong Saul ashita chi athei tahin, aman zong anamsau abaw a ashi khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul leh atapa thumte leh agalvan tawipa tualeh agalkap zousie toh khumni mama in ashi khawm chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh phaijang gallang khat a um Israel mite leh Jordan gallang khat a umten, Israel galkapte taizah leh Saul leh atapate ashita uh chi amu tah un, akhopite uh anua sie ua, ataimangta uhi. Tuachi’n Philistin mite ahing pei ua, tua khopite ah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n azingni in, hichi ahi a, Philistin miten agal thate uh puonsil hawh dinga ahing pei u’leh Gilboa muol tunga Saul leh atapa thumte luong ava muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n alu atan ua, agalvan ahawh ua, tuami thu khu amilim biehna innte u’leh mipite kunga phuongzah dingin Philistin gamsung pumpi ah thangkou asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n agalvante khu Ashtoreth bieh inn ah akoi ua, tualeh aluong khu Bethshan kulpi bang ah ata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Jabesh-Gilead khuo a teng miten Saul abawl dante uh ana zah tah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihangsan zousie akipandoh ua, zan tungtawn in apei ua, Saul leh atapate luong Beth-Shan kulpi banga kipan ava lakhie ua, tualeh Jabesh ahing tut ua, tuanah ahaltumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n agu teng uh a la khawm ua, Jabesh mun a Tamarisk sing nuoi ah avui ua, ni sagi sung ann angawl uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
